<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">EN_CLT cua_Tiếng⋅Co_ltr Thu Feb 13 2025 16:49:51 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Revelation</para>
  <para style="toc1">Rahlăp Khaih-hwuyên</para>
  <para style="toc2">Khaih-hwuyên</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rev</para>
  <para style="mt">Khaih-hwuyên</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Varơuq kahnoq vlôh ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu đơu Kơy Plêêk heq kahniq ka Kadraq xôq pato vlôh ka khơl xapok Kadraq kaluh kajoq pheq xalih truh kach thier talăng. Kadraq heq kahnoq vlôh, atêq tuôôy gamưh yaak plêêk ku Kadraq atăq truh ka Jăng, xapok ku Kadraq, <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />laa manih heq dơơp xanưk truh apok ku Kơy Plêêk ji apok xanưk ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, 'ngưq laa kaluh varơuq kơy heq 'yo hloq. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Vanong ka manih đok ji manih tameng kaluh apok ku rahlăp hlit neq, kung dii tameng jư kaluh kajoq heq jah valơk đom nưq, vii kawat jeq yôôch.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Jăng atăq ka pơh tayuup vah aduq dêh A-si: Apôôy oh ay jah vanong plêêk dii varơuq hrok hrol xing Kơy đong e, heq e, ji đong truh, kung đaji xing pơh yaak kangưưr ngaai ku Kadraq, <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />ji xing Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, laa “Manih Xanưk Jư Apok”, “Kơy pahleh adroyq nhưk” xing aduq kaxêêt, ji “Kơy dưk xakaq khơl vuua tol vari”. Awih truh Kơy xung xiaq haay, heq wơơt xok haay klơlh kadrôôp maroh ku haay gamưh vahaap Kadraq, <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />ji Kadraq heq khienq haay jêêk muuyq daak, jêêk vlôh khơl thơy tơơk tưp ka Kơy Plêêk, Vaq ku Kadraq — apôôy tađnah tađnaak ji taay yaak axuq ka Kadraq dong truh đơơy đơơy. Amen.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />“'Yo hơq, Kadraq truh kung dii kaluh đum kluk,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 1:7">ji “tôôy mot hnoq 'yo hloq Kadraq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 1:7">hloay kaah khơl adro heq tăp Kadraq,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 1:7">yôôch tôôy tamooy tol vari “hnoq nhim alo vii kơq Kadraq.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 1:7">Jơq anưq, Amen.<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />Lôôk laa Kơy Plêêk xanoh: “Gô laa An-pha ji Ô-mê-ga, Kơy đong e, heq e, ji đong truh, Kơy Taay Yaak.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">muuyq xôq rahlăp đok: </char><char style="fqa">Lôôk ji Kơy Plêêk xanoh: Gô ji An-pha ji Ô-mê-ga, ji luh kapa tep ji lôôch dik.</char></note><verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Gô laa Jăng — dro oh ay ji manih kung ahlook dii oh ay truh varơuq pơơl dal, daak plêêk, ji varơuq atuq xuum chiuq uunq đom Lôôk Jê-xu — gô măn tol đoot tahli jah taayh laa Bat-mô vii kơq apok ku Kơy Plêêk ji apok xanưk ku Lôôk Jê-xu. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Muut hngơy ku Lôôk, gô măn đom Kơy Phool Hiel, ji gô tameng pi katoor gô muuyq apok đnooy kôt đaji hnưm keeng, <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />đaneq: “Dayh valơk muut rahlăp kaluh kajoq koot hloq ji atăq truh pơh tayuup vah — ka Ê-phê-sô, Si-miêk-nơ, Bet-găm, Thi-a-ti-rơ, Sat-đe, Phi-la-đen-phi-a, ji Lao-đi-xê.” <verse eid="REV 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Gô wih hlê xôq 'yo apok đơu đong đnooy dii gô, yôôch atêq tuôôy wih hlê, gô 'yo hloq pơh jôôk đeen bơơn vajang, <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />ji măn katul kaluh jôôk đeen e Kơy dang đaji Koot Manih, hlưp aau yơơt truh jôôk, kung dii muuyq talơy hnek bơơn vajang jah hnek pangach tada. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Akoq ji hlôôk ku Kadraq yôôych ko đaji hlôôk trưưu, ko đaji raak parier, mot Kadraq yôôych dang gooy ôôlh, <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />jôôk Kadraq đaji đông tađnah ah, đaji heq jah arieq đom loo, xarooy Kadraq dang đaji hnưm ku 'ngưng alook daak, <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />e pơh xalok tol ti akoh ku Kadraq, ji muuyq poop xieh vaarq pla mưr charik vlôh xing huuy Kadraq, măn ma mot Kadraq yôôych đaji mot hngơy tađnah rưk tuôôy ni xaraar tađnah dêq mưk. <verse eid="REV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Tuôôy gô hloq Kadraq, gô gưlh pôôt aduq jôôk Kadraq đaji manih kaxêêt, yôôch Kadraq xôq ti akoh ku Kadraq tol gô, xanoh: “Te yôq. Gô laa Kơy adroyq dik ji lôôch dik, <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />kung laa Kơy hloay riirh; Gô heq chiuq kaxêêt, ji 'yo nee, Gô riirh dong truh đơơy đơơy miet miet, Gô adrơk jư gay kal ku varơuq kaxêêt ji âm phuh. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Vii anưq, dayh valơk hlê kaluh varơuq koot heq hloq, kaluh varơuq đong e ji kaluh kajoq jeq xalih truh atêq kaluh varơuq neq. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Neq laa varơuq kadook padu ku pơh poop xalok đơu koot heq hloq đom ti akoh ku Gô, kung pơh jôôk đeen vajang: Pơh poop xalok laa khơl yaak plêêk ku pơh tayuup vah, ji pơh jôôk đeen laa pơh tayuup vah.<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />Dayh valơk ka yaak plêêk ku tayuup vah aduq Ê-phê-sô đaneq:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:1">‘Kơy adrơk pơh poop xalok đom ti akoh Kadraq, laa Kơy tawaak hooy măn katul pơh jôôk đeen bơơn vajang, xanoh luneq: <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />“Gô xet kaluh varơuq dơơp ku koot, varơuq pơơl kung varơuq atuq xuum chiuq uunq ku koot, Gô kung xet đaneq koot leh ik chiuq xôq adro xơk, koot heq thư khơl adro kadih xưng laa khơl jah rơơlh đơu oot be aalq laa đanưq, ji koot heq 'yo xet oot laa pa ôôh lar; <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />koot kung e varơuq wêêt xuum, ji heq chiuq pơơl vii kơq yal Gô đơu leh galeh galal. <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Lunư, Gô e varơuq toah koot, nưq laa koot heq ka'lăk hlơơp xuum xung xiaq kapa tep ku koot. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Vii anưq, dayh văch hlê koot heq gưlh talaalh xing leq, dayh wiit xuum ji dơơp kaluh varơuq kapa tep. Măn atoh lưp, Gô hnoq truh dii koot ji Gô hnoq deep ka'lăk jôôk đeen ku koot klơlh aduq ni — atoh koot leh wiit xuum. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Bơh koot e varơuq neq, nưq laa koot 'yarơ kaluh varơuq dơơp ku tayuup Ni-kô-la, laa kaluh varơuq đơu Gô kung 'yarơ. <verse eid="REV 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />Kơyq e tôôr, dayh tameng apok Kơy Phool Hiel xanoh kung kaluh tayuup vah. Đôôyq dii manih jah jay, Gô hnoq ăm ka manih nưq xa play vlôh xing ưk varơuq riirh măn đom Ba-ra-đi ku Kơy Plêêk.”’<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />Dayh valơk ka yaak plêêk ku tayuup vah aduq Si-miêk-nơ đaneq:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:8">‘Kơy adroyq dik ji lôôch dik, Kơy heq chiuq kaxêêt ji heq riirh hlê, Kadraq xanoh luneq: <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />“Gô xet kaluh pơơl hwơơl ku koot ji varơuq adrah aduq koot (đơu wih hlê, koot đong karoh e), kung apok đnooy pahnhiq truh xing khơl adro xưng kadih oot laa manih Jo Thaiq đơu oot be aalq, bơh laa hnhư tayuup ku Sa-tan. <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Te yôq kajoq dêq đôôyq dii kaluh varơuq đơu koot jeq pheq chiuq. 'Yo hơq, kamuuych jeq taweek taleq dro đom khơl koot muut tu xôq ka êêp koot biq thư, ji khơl koot hnoq chiuq pơơl dal đom kưl hngơy. Dayh muuyq xuum dong truh kaxêêt, yôôch Gô hnoq kahniq ka koot đoat tađnah ku varơuq riirh. <verse eid="REV 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />Kơyq e tôôr, dayh tameng apok Kơy Phool Hiel xanoh kung kaluh tayuup vah. Manih jah jay hnoq leh e 'leq biq haiq bơyh varơuq kaxêêt yưk vaarq.”’<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />Dayh valơk ka yaak plêêk ku tayuup vah aduq Bet-găm đaneq:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:12">‘Kơy e poop xieh vaarq pla mưr charik xanoh luneq: <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />“Gô xet aduq koot riirh, aduq nưq laa ngaai ku Sa-tan, đơu koot heq jư kajưk xok yal Gô, ji leh chôôyq ka'lăk xuum tuôq aduq Gô, hloay kah đom kaluh hngơy ku An-ti-ba, manih xanưk ku Gô, manih muuyq xuum dii Gô, laa manih biq păk kaxêêt kangưưr êêp koot, aduq đơu Sa-tan măn. <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Lunư, Gô e taleq varơuq toah koot, nưq laa kađnư, koot e taleq adro jư xok trôôk pato ku Ba-la-am, laa adro heq pato Ba-lak xôq kuk phơu dơơp xatôôlh jôôk kangưưr koot xau I-sơ-ra-ên xôq xa tuôông đơơp ka vangưl ji dơơp varơuq apuq atrăp. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Tyauq trôôk dang đanưq, koot kung e taleq adro jư xok apok pato ku tayuup Ni-kô-la. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Vii anưq, dayh wiit xuum yơu! Măn atoh lưp, Gô hnoq talăng dayh truh dii koot, ji hnoq hmơt tagoa tachơơl dii oot bơơn xieh ku huuy Gô. <verse eid="REV 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />Kơyq e tôôr, dayh tameng apok Kơy Phool Hiel xanoh dii kaluh tayuup vah. Đôôyq dii manih jah jay, Gô hnoq kahniq ka ni ma-na kadook padu, ji Gô hnoq kahniq ka ni muuyq kuk phơu ko đơu tol kuk phơu nưq, muuyq yal đơơu heq jah valơk. Laa yal đơu be kơyq xet đêh vlôh manih nhonq jah ni.”’<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />Dayh valơk ka yaak plêêk ku tayuup vah aduq Thi-a-ti-rơ đaneq:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:18">‘Koot Kơy Plêêk, Kơy e mot đaji gooy ôôlh ji jôôk đaji đông tađnah ah, xanoh luneq: <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />“Gô xet kaluh varơuq dơơp ku koot, xung xiaq, xuum tuôq, varơuq hơu varơuq, kung xuum atuq kajưk ku koot, ji kaluh varơuq dơơp ku koot atêq neq măn galơh iaq kaluh varơuq tuôôy adroyq. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Bơh Gô e varơuq neq toah koot, nưq laa koot đong chiuq xôq mo Jê-sa-bên, adro kadih 'yo ni laa mo hlit, ji ni pato dayq kung adô aluut khơl xapok ku Gô lôp kadrôôp apuq atrăp ji xa tuôông đơơp vangưl. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Gô heq ăm ka ni kawat xôq ni hnoq ik wiit xuum, đơu ni leh trôôch wiit xuum truh varơuq apuq atrăp ku ni. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Dayh 'yo nee! Gô hnoq taweek ni moq lêêt tol chanưng, ji khơl adro lôp kadrôôp apuq atrăp kung ni muut varơuq pơơl dal kôt, atoh oot leh wiit xuum truh kaluh varơuq dơơp ku ni. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Gô hnoq hmơt khơl koot xau ni bơơn varơuq kaxêêt, yôôch dêq hloay kaluh tayuup vah hnoq xet đaneq Gô laa Kơy 'yo hloq xuum klaak, ji Gô hnoq kahniq ka tôôy dro đom êêp koot tyauq tưng kaluh varơuq dơơp ku êêp koot. <verse eid="REV 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />Bơh Gô xanoh dii khơl koot, laa sôôq măn hlê đom khơl manih aduq Thi-a-ti-rơ, long kơyq leh jư tyauq apok pato nưq, 'ngưq laa khơl dro leh xet kaluh varơuq jaruq ku Sa-tan, đaji muuyq sôôq adro taayh nưq, đaneq: "Gô leh xôq pơq parêq leq đnoyq tol êêp koot. <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Lunư, pheq jư kajưk xok kaluh kajoq khơl koot e dong truh tuôôy leq Gô truh."<verse eid="REV 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />Đôôyq dii manih jah jay ji kưq jư xok kaluh varơuq dơơp ku Gô dong truh lôôch dik, yôôych Gô hnoq kahniq ka dro nưq qwuyen da uh tol kaluh daak dêh.<verse eid="REV 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />"Dro nưq hnoq dưk xakaq oot bơơn muuyq gay katôôlh maam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 2:27">dang đaji kaluh wo vari dik biq pôh padah padek,"<verse eid="REV 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />kung đaji Gô heq nhonq jah qwuyen xing Vaq Gô, yôôych Gô hnoq kahniq ka dro nưq xalok maai. <verse eid="REV 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />Kơyq e tôôr, dayh tameng apok Kơy Phool Hiel xanoh kung kaluh tayuup vah.”’<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />Dayh valơk ka yaak plêêk ku tayuup vah aduq Sat-đe, đaneq:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:1">‘Kơy e pơh yaak ku Kơy Plêêk ji pơh poop xalok xanoh luneq: “Gô xet kaluh varơuq dơơp ku koot. Koot e ahlôôk laa riirh, đơu koot yôôych kaxêêt. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Dayh parol 'yo ji dơơp ka kajưk kalh kaluh kajoq măn hlê, 'ngưq laa kaluh varơuq jeq kaxêêt, vii Gô koq hloq kaluh varơuq dơơp ku koot jah payôôch kangưưr Kơy Plêêk ku Gô. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Vii anưq, dayh văch hlê kaluh varơuq koot heq nhonq ji heq tameng. Dayh tameng tyauq đnư đơu wiit xuum yơu. Măn atoh koot leh parol 'yo, Gô hnoq truh đaji adro atôk, ji koot kajưk dik hnoq leh xet wat leq Gô truh tachơơl hlê koot. <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Lunư, koot e taleq dro aduq Sat-đe, laa khơl dro heq leh dơơp a'moh qwuân aau oot, ji oot hnoq hooy kung dii Gô đom qwuân aau ko, vii oot taxưngq. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Manih jah jay hnoq jah hlưp muut aau yơơt ko dang đanưq, Gô hnoq leh e 'leq 'nhuôôt anơng dro nưq klơlh Rahlăp Varơuq Riirh, ji Gô hnoq xưng anơng ku dro nưq kangưưr Vaq Gô ji kangưưr khơl yaak plêêk Kadraq. <verse eid="REV 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />Kơyq e tôôr, dayh tameng apok Kơy Phool Hiel xanoh kung kaluh tayuup vah.”’<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />Dayh valơk ka yaak plêêk ku tayuup vah aduq Phi-la-đen-phi-a đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 3:7">‘Kơy Vah, Kơy Dong Dik,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 3:7">Kơy adrơk jư gay kal ku Đa-vik,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 3:7">Kơy luh yôôych leh kơyq hnoq kađnoch,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 3:7">ji kađnoch yôôych leh kơyq luh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 3:7">xanoh luneq:<verse eid="REV 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />“Gô xet kaluh varơuq dơơp ku koot ('Yo hơq, Gô heq xôq kangưưr koot muuyq 'mok ranưh luh đơu leh kơyq e paraat kađnoch ni), vii koot e axit paraat, đơu koot heq tameng jư apok Gô, ji leh chôôyq ka'lăk yal Gô. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />'Yo nee, Gô hnoq khienq khơl adro thuôk hnhư tayuup ku Sa-tan, laa khơl adro kadih nhonq oot laa manih Jo Thaiq đơu leh aalq đanưq, wih hlê, oot vơơ laa đong đnooy pa ôôh — 'Yo hơq, Gô hnoq khienq oot dơơp aleq ka oot hnoq truh ji kul pôôt aduq kangưưr jôôk koot, ji oot hnoq ik xet đaneq Gô xiaq koot. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Vii koot heq jư apok atuq xuum ku Gô, lunưq Gô kung hnoq jư koot klơlh wat varơuq thư jeq truh tol loch dêh araak, xôq thưh khơl adro đong riirh tol vari. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Gô đong truh kach talăng dayh. Dayh jư kajưk varơuq koot e xôq be kơyq hnoq ik xok hlơơp đoat tađnah ku koot. <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />Dro leq jah jay, Gô hnoq khienq dro nưq jêêk vlôh gok đom hnhư hơu ku Kơy Plêêk Gô. Dro nưq hnoq be dong leq vlôh klơlh đnư đnoyq, ji Gô hnoq valơk tol ni yal ku Kơy Plêêk Gô, anơng theng ku Kơy Plêêk Gô (Jê-ru-sa-lem đơơu kahri pôôt xing plêêk, xing aduq Kơy Plêêk ku Gô), ji yal đơơu ku Gô. <verse eid="REV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />Kơyq e tôôr, dayh tameng apok Kơy Phool Hiel xanoh kung kaluh tayuup vah.”’<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />Dayh valơk ka yaak plêêk ku tayuup vah aduq Lao-đi-xê, đaneq:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:14">‘Kơy Amen, Manih Xanưk đangq tuôq ji dong dik, Xarôp Dơơp varơuq panưk pajêêk ku Kơy Plêêk xanoh luneq: <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />“Gô xet kaluh varơuq dơơp ku koot, đaneq koot leh jaleek, kung leh tôq. Ưng kajoq koot jaleek raa jaleek long tôq raa tôq! <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Anưq yôôych, vii koot hôôm hôôm, leh tôq kung leh jaleek, lunưq Gô jeq hăk koot vlôh klơlh huuy Gô. <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Vii koot đnooy đaneq: "Gô karoh, gô heq vlôh jêêk raah jôh, ji gô be e duh kajoq dêq," anưq đơu koot leh xet đaneq koot dik pơơl hwơơl, tarôôy dik, adrah, apul ji lalôk. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Gô ahmưk koot root xing aduq Gô vajang heq jah arieq đom ôôlh xôq koot vlôh jêêk karoh e, root aau yơơt ko ploak xôq koot hlưp muut đơu leh măn kahnoq vlôh varơuq kamưưl vii varơuq lalôk ku koot, ji root jarơơu katoh mot xôq katoh mot ku koot xôq ka koot 'yo hloq ik. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />Long Khơl leq đơu Gô xung xiaq, yôôych Gô toah pato ji 'meq dook. Lunưq, dayh kalh paraat ji wiit xuum yơu. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />'Yo hơq, Gô dưk ka 'mok ji pah. Atoh kơyq tameng xarooy Gô ji luh 'mok, yôôych Gô hnoq muut kung dro nưq, xa waal dii ni, ji ni dii Gô. <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Dro leq jah jay, Gô hnoq ăm dro nưq 'ngôôy dii Gô tol ngaai Gô, đaji Gô kung heq jah jay ji 'ngôôy dii Vaq Gô tol ngaai Kadraq. <verse eid="REV 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />Kơyq e tôôr, dayh tameng apok Kơy Phool Hiel xanoh kung kaluh tayuup vah.”’”<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Atêq kaluh varơuq nưq, gô 'yo hloq ji hơq, muuyq poop 'mok jah luh vlôh tol plêêk, yôôch xarooy thưq nhưk đơu gô heq tameng xanoh dii gô đaji hnưm keeng, đnooy đaneq: “Dayh tok đnen, yôôch Gô hnoq pato ka koot hloq kaluh varơuq pheq xalih truh atêq kaluh varơuq neq.” <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Hloay jơnưq, gô măn đom Kơy Phool Hiel, ji 'yo hơq, muuyq ngaai jah xôq tol plêêk! Ji e muuyq Kơy đong 'ngôôy tol ngaai. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Kơy 'ngôôy tol ngaai dii 'yo tamaq dang đaji ngok thach anh ji ngok mah naoh, ji e muuyq mo adreek măn rawiit ngaai dii 'yo tamaq dang đaji ngok luk bưuh. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Rawiit gah ngaai e vaarq kưl poot poop ngaai, ji 'ngôôy tol ngaai laa vaarq kưl poot khơl draq jah hlưp muut aau yơơt ko, dii đoat tađnah bơơn vajang tol akoq oot. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Xing ngaai xađnek vlôh kaluh kablek tađnah, hnưm garung garung, kung hnưm kơy kata. Pơh gay đeen ôôlh đong jaq kangưưr ngaai, 'ngưq laa pơh yaak ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Kangưưr ngaai dang đaji muuyq tahli ramil, dang đaji pha lê, măn aduq katul ngaai ji rawiit gah ngaai laa poot poop ôô, viik kaluh kalong mot, pi ngưưr hloay pi katoor. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Ôô thưq nhưk dang ôô vomq, ôô thưq vaarq dang bo koot, ôô thưq pe e mamưưt đaji ku manih, ji ôô thưq poot dang xêêp kalaak kôt đong pơl. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Poot poop ôô, tôôy muuyq poop đom sôôq nưq ji e drơu panưr rawiit, pi'lăp viik kaluh kalong mot, ji hngơy hloay klôôy, oot be e varơuq padơy ơơr tuôôy đnooy đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:8">“Vah hloay, vah hloay, vah hloay laa Lôôk, Kơy Plêêk Taay Yaak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:8">Kơy heq e, đong e ji đong truh.”<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Long tuôôy leq kaluh ôô tơơk tưp tađnah tađnaak, varơuq 'yo vado, ji apok kuh kway ka Kơy 'ngôôy tol ngaai, 'ngưq laa Kơy riirh dong truh đơơy đơơy, miet miet, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />yôôych vaarq kưl poot khơl draq hnoq kul xăk pôôt kangưưr Kơy 'ngôôy tol ngaai, ji kuh kul Kơy riirh dong truh đơơy đơơy, miet miet, ji oot xôq đoat tađnah oot pôôt kangưưr ngaai, tơơl đaneq:<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />“Kuh Lôôk ji Kơy Plêêk 'wot,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">Kadraq dik xưngq đangq nhonq xok tađnah tađnaak, varơuq 'yo vado, ji taay yaak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:11">vii Kadraq heq panưk jêêk tôôy paroh;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">kung bơyh iq trôôch Kadraq đơu kaluh paroh măn hlê ji jah panưk jêêk.”<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Yôôch gô hloq đom ti akoh ku Kơy 'ngôôy tol ngaai muuyq rahlăp jơyq heq jah valơk pi'lăp hloay pi gôk, jah kal kwat bơyh pơh hlêêl dơuq. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Gô kung hloq muuyq yaak plêêk kalh paraat kôt apok đnooy: “Kơyq xưngq đangq luh rahlăp jơyq ji tơq kaluh dơuq kal kwat ku ni?” <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Be kơyq tol plêêk long 'laarq vari long pi 'laarq vari hnoq ik luh rahlăp jơyq long 'yo muut ni. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Nưq laa gô nhim ook vii leh kơyq jah axek hloq laa xưngq đangq xôq luh rahlăp jơyq long đok ni. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Yôôch muuyq đom khơl draq đnooy dii gô: “Te nhim. 'Yo hơq! Ôô Vomq, Kơy vlôh xing adrơơk Ju-đa, Xamok ku Đa-vik, Kadraq heq jah jay xôq luh rahlăp jơyq kung pơh dơuq kal kwat ku ni.” <verse eid="REV 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Ji măn katul ngaai kung poot poop ôô, ji măn katul khơl draq, gô hloq Trưưu Koot đong dưk, đaji heq biq păk kaxêêt, e pơh akê ji pơh kalong mot, 'ngưq laa pơh yaak ku Kơy Plêêk jah patăk truh loch vari. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Kadraq truh ji nhonq xok rahlăp jơyq xing ti akoh ku Kơy 'ngôôy tol ngaai. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Tuôôy Kadraq heq nhonq xok rahlăp jơyq, poot poop ôô ji vaarq kưl poot khơl draq kul xăk pôôt kangưưr Trưưu Koot, tôôy dro e muuyq poop varo haak ji muuyq poop dooy bơơn vajang xôq viik kahlơu, 'ngưq laa kaluh apok apôôy ku khơl vah. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Oot kacheeu muuyq baai kacheeu đơơu, đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">“Kadraq xưngq đangq nhonq xok rahlăp jơyq</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">ji luh kaluh dơuq kal kwat ku ni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">vii Kadraq heq biq păk kaxêêt ji bơyh vahaap kadraq, Kadraq root xuq ka Kơy Plêêk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">khơl manih thuôk tôôy adrơơk, apok athêêk, tôôy tamooy ji daak dêh.<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Kadraq heq khienq oot jêêk vlôh muuyq daak dêh ji khơl thơy tơơk tưp ka Kơy Plêêk haay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">ji oot hnoq dưk xakaq tol vari.”<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Yôôch gô 'yo hloq ji tameng xarooy ku 'ngưng yaak plêêk rawiit gah ngaai kung dii poot poop ôô ji khơl draq, đơu dêq hloay sôôq ku oot laa karavơu ku karavơu kawaan ku kawaan, <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />kung xarooy đnooy kôt:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 5:12">“Trưưu Koot heq biq păk kaxêêt, dik laa xưngq đangq xôq nhonq xok taay yaak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:12">karoh e, khôôt xet, kalh paraat, jah vado, tađnah tađnaak, ji ayuôôt laat.”<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Yôôch gô tameng tôôy paroh jah panưk jêêk tol plêêk, 'laarq vari, pi 'laarq vari, tol tahli, ji tôôy paroh đom oot, đnooy đaneq:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 5:13">“Apôôy ka Kơy 'ngôôy tol ngôôy kung Trưưu Koot jah ayuôôt laat, jah vado, tađnah tađnaak, ji taay yaak dong truh đơơy đơơy, miet miet.”<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Poot poop ôô đnooy: “Amen!” măn khơl draq kul xăk pôôt ji kuh ayuôôt. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Muuyq sôôq rahlăp hnu iaq đok: </char><char style="fqa">vaarq kưl poot khơl draq kul xăk pôôt ji kuh ayuôôt Kơy riirh đơơy đơơy, hloay hloay</char>.</note><verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Yôôch gô 'yo hloq tuôôy Trưưu Koot luh muuyq đom pơh dơuq kal kwat, ji gô tek muuyq đom poot poop ôô đnooy đaji hnưm kơy jaru, đaneq: “Dayh truh!” <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Nưq laa gô 'yo hloq ji hơq, muuyq poop ôô ahleh ko! Manih acho tol ôô ahleh nưq e muuyq poop nook, ji muuyq đoat tađnah jah kahniq ka ni, yôôch dro nưq hooy vlôh đaji dro heq jay xôq jah jay.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Tuôôy Trưưu Koot luh dơuq kal kwat thưq vaarq, gô tameng poop ôô thưq vaarq dăt: “Dayh truh!” <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Nưq laa muuyq poop ôô ahleh kadrơy rama vlôh, phôôm dôôp đaji ôôlh. Đôôyq dii manih acho tol ôô ahleh neq yôôych heq jah kahniq ka ni qwuyen xok hlơơp varơuq tagu klơlh vari, xôq khơl drơy hnoq păk kaxêêt mamuuyq, ji muuyq poop xieh thier kôt heq jah kahniq ka dro nưq.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Tuôôy Trưưu Koot luh dơuq kal kwat thưq pe, gô tameng poop ôô thưq pe đnooy: “Dayh truh!” Nưq laa gô 'yo hloq ji hơq, muuyq ôô ahleh ju, ji dro acho tol ôô ahleh neq e muuyq poop kon tol ti ni. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Yôôch gô tameng đaji e xarooy măn katul poot poop ôô, đaneq: “Muuyq hlơk va away dii muuyq đơ-ni-ê; pe hlơk va away dii muuyq đơ-ni-ê. Ji te đungq truh jơu ji lok.”<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Tuôôy Trưưu Koot luh dơuq kal kwat thưq poot, gô tameng apok ku poop ôô thưq poot đnooy: “Dayh truh!” <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Nưq laa gô 'yo hloq ji hơq, muuyq ôô ahleh adriilh paal. Adro acho tol ôô ahleh neq, anơng ni laa Varơuq Kaxêêt, ji âm phuh kung hooy tyauq atêq ni. E qwuyen măn tol muuyq phon poot raak vari heq jah kahniq ka oot, xôq păk kaxêêt bơơn xieh jaauq, pangoot hrah, jich bingq, ji bơyh kaluh ôô kadumq tol vari.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Tuôôy Trưưu Koot luh dơuq kal kwat thưq dăp, gô hloq 'laarq para hơu phool hiel ku khơl dro heq biq păk kaxêêt vii apok ku Kơy Plêêk ji vii apok xanưk đơu oot heq jư. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Oot kung xarooy taayh kôt đaneq: “Kuh Kơy Chuh Têêh, Kơy hlăng vah ji dong dik, dong truh tuôôy leq đơu Kadraq măn koq xưh xadrah ji bla kadrôôp ka vahaap ku 'wot koot xing khơl adro măn riirh tol vari?” <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Yôôch tôôy dro đom oot jah kahniq ăm muuyq aau yơơt ko, ji oot jah dăt đaneq oot măn duh takôô axit tra đnoyq dong truh tuôôy jah đu sôôq khơl 'wơyq achung varơuq dơơp ku oot hloay khơl oh ay ku oot, laa khơl dro jeq biq păk kaxêêt kung dang đaji oot.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Tuôôy Trưưu Koot luh dơuq kal kwat thưq drơu, gô 'yo, ji e muuyq đơơt ahrưng vari kôt, yôôch mot hngơy jêêk vlôh kamơng jaluk đaji aau vaayh vlêêt bơơn hlôôk, măn dêq hloay xiêk yôôych jêêk vlôh dang đaji vahaap, <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />ji kaluh xalok tol plêêk kađnih pôôt vari, dang đaji ưk pok puut rôh play patah ku ni tuôôy biq khiel kôt klôôp anhưh. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Lawah plêêk phuch hlơơp đaji muuyq ahnom jơyq biq ahnom hlê, ji kaluh ngok đoot kung ngok tahli raay biq katơơk klơlh aduq ku ni. <verse eid="REV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Yôôch khơl vuua tol vari kung khơl padrok, khơl dưk xanok kuun, khơl karoh e, khơl e qwuyen lưk, ji tôôy adro xapok kung khơl rayơh rayơơy, raay du xăk klôônq đom kaluh troop kôôp ji măn katul kaluh talaat phơu tol kaluh ngok đoot; <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />Oot đnooy dii kaluh ngok đoot ji kaluh kuk phơu: “Dayh hrưp pôôt tol 'wot ji galôp đơ 'wot klơlh mot ku Kơy 'ngôôy tol ngaai ji klơlh đơơt tôq jaraq ku Trưưu Koot, <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />Vii hngơy tôq jaraq kôt ku khơl Kơy nưq heq truh, yôôych kơyq hnoq ik chiuq nôôy?”<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Atêq varơuq nưq, gô hloq poot yaak plêêk măn dưk poot muum vari, jư kajưk poot ngưưr khiel ku vari xôq khiel leh klôôp tol vari, long tol tahli, long tol ưk gay leq. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Yôôch gô hloq muuyq yaak plêêk kadrơy hooy tok xing ngưưr mot hngơy vlok, đong adrơk dơuq ku Kơy Plêêk hloay riirh. Kơy kôt apok taayh poot kơy yaak plêêk, laa khơl kơy đơu qwuyen heq jah kahniq ka oot xôq dơơp pahư vari ji tahli, <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />đaneq: “Te dơơp pahư vari, long tahli, long ưk ôôlh, dong truh tuôôy haay heq hnoq ik đongq dơuq khơl xapok ku Kơy Plêêk haay măn tol ngưưl ku oot.” <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Gô tameng sôôq manih jah đongq dơuq laa muuyq hreek poot kưl poot ravơu, 'ngưq laa khơl dro jah đongq dơuq xing aduq tôôy adrơơk koot xau I-sơ-ra-ên:<verse eid="REV 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />xing adrơơk Ju-đa, kưl vaarq ravơu manih jah đongq dơuq;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:5">xing adrơơk Ru-bên, kưl vaarq ravơu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:5">xing adrơơk Gat, kưl vaarq ravơu;<verse eid="REV 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />xing adrơơk A-se, kưl vaarq ravơu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:6">xing adrơơk Nep-ta-li, kưl vaarq ravơu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:6">xing adrơơk Ma-na-se, kưl vaarq ravơu;<verse eid="REV 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />xing adrơơk Si-mê-ôn, kưl vaarq ravơu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:7">xing adrơơk Lê-vi, kưl vaarq ravơu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:7">xing adrơơk I-sa-ka, kưl vaarq ravơu;<verse eid="REV 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />xing adrơơk Sa-bu-lôn, kưl vaarq ravơu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:8">xing adrơơk Jô-sep, kưl vaarq ravơu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:8">xing adrơơk Bên-ja-min, kưl vaarq ravơu manih heq jah đongq dơuq.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Atêq kaluh varơuq nưq, gô 'yo hloq, ji hơq, muuyq bing manih thier karôp đơu leh e kơyq hnoq jauq ik bing karôp nưq, truh xing tôôy daak dêh, kaluh adrơơk, kaluh tamooy ji apok athêêk, đong dưk kangưưr ngaai ji kangưưr Trưưu Koot, tuôôy jah hlưp aau yơơt ko, ji kaluh đook gay cha laa đom ti oot, <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />yôôch oot đnooy kôt apok, đaneq:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 7:10">“Varơuq wơơt xok thuôk axuq Kơy Plêêk haay, Kơy đong 'ngôôy tol ngaai, ji thuôk xuq Trưưu Koot!”<verse eid="REV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Nưq laa dêq hloay yaak plêêk đong dưk rawiit ngaai kung khơl draq ji poot poop ôô raay kul xagul mot oot pôôt kangưưr ngaai đơu kuh ayuôôt Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />đaneq:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 7:12">“Amen! Varơuq ayuôôt laat, tađnah tađnaak, khôôt xet, kuh kway, jah vado, taay yaak, kung paraat kalh raay thuôk xuq Kơy Plêêk haay dong truh đơơy đơơy, miet miet! Amen!”<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Yôôch muuyq đom khơl draq đnooy dii gô, đaneq: “Khơl dro jah hlưp aau yơơt ko hơq — oot laa kơyq, ji oot xing leq truh?” <verse eid="REV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Gô đnooy kung kơy: “Kuh lôôk gô, kadraq xet varơuq neq.” Yôôch, kơy nưq đnooy dii gô: “Neq laa khơl dro heq truh xing Đơơt Pơơl Dal Kôt, oot heq arôôh aau yơơt oot, ji dơơp oot jêêk ko đom vahaap Trưưu Koot.<verse eid="REV 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Vii kakơq neq, oot jah măn kangưưr ngaai Kơy Plêêk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">klôôy hngơy ayuôôt laat Kadraq đom hnhư hơu Kadraq.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">Ji Kơy 'ngôôy tol ngaai hnoq panưk raap măn tol oot.<verse eid="REV 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Oot hnoq paq măn pangoot đnoyq, kung hnoq paq măn thaal đnoyq,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">mot hngơy long dêq hloay xal tôq leq, hnoq leh e 'leq huur vuh oot,<verse eid="REV 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />Vii Trưưu Koot, Kơy măn katul ngaai, hnoq xakaq 'yo oot,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">Kadraq hnoq jarooy oot truh alook daak varơuq riirh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 7:17">ji Kơy Plêêk hnoq 'nhuôôt kateh dêq tôôy daak mot klơlh mot oot.”<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Tuôôy Trưưu Koot luh dơuq kal kwat thưq pơh, e varơuq hnhep tol plêêk đom kawah panoot wat. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Yôôch gô hloq pơh kơy yaak plêêk, đơu oot dưk kangưưr Kơy Plêêk, ji pơh poop keeng jah ăm ka oot.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Muuyq yaak plêêk kadrơy truh, adrơk dooy kahlơu bơơn vajang, dưk aduq para hơu, ji 'ngưng kahlơu jah kahniq ka yaak plêêk nưq xôq hnoq ik tơơk tưp achung dii kaluh apok apôôy ku tôôy khơl vah tol para hơu bơơn vajang măn kangưưr ngaai. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />'Nhuuy kahlơu, kung dii apok apôôy ku khơl vah, xing ti kơy yaak plêêk pơl tok kangưưr Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Yaak plêêk xok dooy kahlơu, ji galôp viik ni bơơn ôôlh ku para hơu, yôôch taweek pôôt vari, yôôych e kaluh hnưm kơy jaru kata, hnưm garung garung, kablek tađnah, kung ahrưng vari.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Yôôch pơh yaak plêêk e pơh poop keeng ralauq xôq kadih oot xôq oot hnoq ik klôôp.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Yaak plêêk thưq nhưk klôôp keeng, yôôych e jit parier ji ôôlh aluq dii vahaap kađnih pôôt vari, yôôch muuyq phon pe vari biq vuh jaq, muuyq phon pe ưk gay biq vuh jaq, ji dêq hloay rek adriilh biq vuh jaq. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Muuyq sôôq rahlăp hnhư iaq ka'lăk apok: </char><char style="fq">muuyq phon pe ưk gay biq vuh jaq</char>.</note><verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Yaak plêêk thưq vaarq klôôp keeng, yôôych e kajoq nưq dang đaji ngok đoot kôt jaq rahưk đom ôôlh biq taweek pôôt tahli, yôôch muuyq phon pe ku tahli jêêk vlôh vahaap, <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />muuyq phon pe kaluh kajoq e varơuq riirh đom tahli raay kaxêêt, ji muuyq phon pe tau ge biq pahyaak ka'lăk.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Yôôch yaak plêêk thưq pe klôôp keeng, yôôych muuyq xalok thier kôt, jaq rahưk đaji gooy xanorq, kađnih pôôt xing tol plêêk, ji ni kađnih pôôt tol muuyq phon pe daak tavook ji tol alook daak. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Anơng ku xalok nưq jah taayh laa Vagaak Pahlăk. Muuyq phon pe kaluh alook daak jêêk vlôh vagaak pahlăk, ji 'ngưng dro kaxêêt jo aduq daak neq vii ni heq jêêk vlôh pahlăk.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Yôôch yaak plêêk thưq poot klôôp keeng, yôôych muuyq phon pe mot hngơy biq hmơt, kung dii muuyq phon pe xiêk ji muuyq phon pe kaluh xalok, xôq ka muuyq phon pe ku oot biq kamơng jaluk, lunưq dêh hngơy dii muuyq phon pe ku ni leh e xaraar tađnah, ji dêh klôôy kung anưq.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Yôôch gô 'yo, ji gô tek muuyq poop xêêp kalaak kôt <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Muuyq sôôq rahlăp xok apok </char><char style="fq">Yaak plêêk </char> thêq ka <char style="fqa">Xêêp kalaak kôt</char>.</note> đong pơl tol lawah plêêk kôt apok đnooy tok: “Ra ơơh hloay, ra ơơh hloay, ra ơơh hloay ka khơl adro riirh 'laarq vari, tuôôy măn e taleq hnưm keeng ku pe kơy yaak plêêk jeq klôôp tok.”<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Yôôch yaak plêêk thưq dăp klôôp keeng, yôôych gô hloq muuyq poop xalok xing plêêk heq klêh pôôt vari, ji gay kal raluk jaruq ku huuk leh e kalek heq jah kahniq ka ni. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Ni luh raluk jaruq ku huuk leh e kalek vlôh, yôôych 'nhuuy xing raluk jaruq tapol tok đaji 'nhuuy ku muuyq loo ôôlh kôt, ji mot hngơy kung không khiq raay biq kamơng hlê jo aduq 'nhuuy ku raluk jaruq neq. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Yôôch xing 'nhuuy nưq, bơy lêêp pachaay vlôh tol vari, ji qwuyen jah kahniq ka bơy lêêp dang đaji qwuyen paroh ding dip e tol vari. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Apok jah patăk ka bơy lêêp nưq laa ni leh dơơp hư rek tol vari long kaluh ưk kaxeq long ưk ôôlh leq, đơu vơ dơơp haiq koot manih, laa khơl adro leh e dơuq ku Kơy Plêêk tol ngưưl oot. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Varơuq jah pahnăp ka bơy lêêp nưq laa ni leh ik păk kaxêêt oot, lunư oot hnoq biq dơơp ra ơơh đom dăp xiêk, ji đơơt dơơp ra ơơh tol oot dang đaji varơuq dơơp ra ơơh xing ding dip tuôôy ni đeet oot. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Đom kaluh hngơy nưq, oot hnoq axek trôôk kaxêêt, bơh oot kajưk dik hnoq leh axek jah ni, ji oot hnoq trôôch kajoq jah kaxêêt, đơu varơuq kaxêêt yôôych chuh xangưưy klơlh oot. <verse eid="REV 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Xăk ku bơy lêêp dang đaji ôô ahleh ralauq xôq vlôh tahmơt. Tol akoq bơy lêêp laa thưq kajoq nưq dang đoat tađnah dang đaji đôô bơơn vajang, măn mamưưt bơy lêêp yôôych dang mamưưt manih. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Bơy lêêp e hlôôk đaji hlôôk khơl drê, ji kaneeng ni yôôych dang đaji ku ôô vomq. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Bơy lêêp e jaap đơ tada dang đaji jaap bơơn maam, ji hnưm panưr ku bơy lêêp dang đaji hnưm ku kaluh xe ôô ahleh, ku 'ngưng poop ôô ahleh đong charuyh muut tahmơt. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Bơy lêêp e hlooy dii nok đeet dang ding dip, ji paraat kalh ku ni đom kaluh hlooy ni xôq dơơp ra ơơh khơl drơy đom dăp xiêk. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Bơy lêêp e vuua măn tol oot laa kamuuych ku huuk leh e kalek. Anơng ni đom apok Hi-baq-lai laa A-ba-đôn, măn đom apok Hi Lap, ni e anơng laa A-bô-li-ôn.<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Đơơt pơơl dal thưq nhưk heq dalơh yôôch. 'Yo hơq, măn e vaarq đơơt pơơl dal đnoyq đong truh atêq kaluh varơuq neq.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Yôôch yaak plêêk thưq drơu klôôp keeng, ji gô tek muuyq apok đnooy vlôh xing kaluh akê ku para hơu bơơn vajang măn kangưưr Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />đnooy ka yaak plêêk thưq drơu, laa kơy đong e poop keeng: “Dayh luh poot yaak plêêk 'miêh biq vek aduq daak kôt Ơ-phơ-rat.” <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Nưq laa poot yaak plêêk, laa khơl kơy heq jah ralauq xôq 'miêh muut klip wat, hngơy, xiêk, xanưm nưq, jah luh vlôh xôq ka oot hnoq ik păk kaxêêt muuyq phon pe manih araak. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Sôôq kuun acho ôô ahleh laa vaarq hreek waan; Gô heq tameng kasôôq ku oot đanưq. <verse eid="REV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Ji đom varơuq ăm xet adroyq, gô heq hloq bơy ôô ahleh ji khơl adro acho tol ôô ahleh đaji luneq — e jaap đơ tada dôôp rưk, ji phôôm adriilh pariaq, kung phôôm drêêk ku lưưu hwinh. Akoq kaluh ôô ahleh neq yôôych dang đaji akoq ôô vomq, xing huuy oot klôôp vlôh ôôlh, 'nhuuy ji lưưu hwinh. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Muuyq phon pe manih araak biq păk kaxêêt jo aduq pe pơơl dal neq, bơyh ôôlh, 'nhuuy, ji lưưu hwinh phuun vlôh xing huuy oot. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Vii paraat kalh ku bơy ôô ahleh laa măn aduq huuy oot ji aduq hlooy oot, jo hlooy oot dang đaji volh e akoq, ji bơyh nưq oot dơơp xưr xôôh khơl drơy. <verse eid="REV 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Phon măn hlê ku manih araak, laa khơl adro koq biq păk kaxêêt bơyh kaluh pơơl dal neq, heq leh wiit xuum truh kaluh varơuq dơơp ku ti oot xôq ka oot hnoq leh kuh ayuôôt kamuuych kung kaluh vangưl bơơn vajang, baak, đông, phơu, ji gay, laa kaluh thưq be hnoq ik 'yo hloq long tameng tek long hooy ik. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Oot kung leh wiit xuum truh kaluh kadrôôp păk kaxêêt manih, đơơp đok, apuq atrăp bơyq ba, long kadrôôp xa atôk ku oot.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Atêq nưq, gô hloq muuyq yaak plêêk paraat kalh kadrơy xing tol plêêk pôôt, jah pahlưp muut muuyq đum kluk, dii mo adreek tol akoq kơy, mamưưt yaak plêêk nưq đaji mot hngơy, jôôk ku kơy nưq yôôych đaji gok ôôlh, <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />ji đong jư đom ti kơy muuyq rahlăp jơyq de heq luh vlôh. Yaak plêêk nưq xôq jôôk akoh kơy tol tahli, măn jôôk akeng tol vari, <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />yôôch taayh atok muuyq apok kôt dang đaji ôô vomq ook. Tuôôy yaak plêêk nưq taayh kôt, yôôych pơh hnưm kơy kata ahna atok dii kaluh apok đnooy ku oot. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Tuôôy pơh hnưm kata ahna vlôh, gô xung valơk hlê, yôôych gô tek muuyq apok đnooy xing plêêk, xanoh: “Dayh đongq dơuq kal kwat kaluh kajoq pơh apok kơy kata heq đnooy, lunưq te valơk oot hlê.” <verse eid="REV 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Yôôch yaak plêêk, đơu gô hloq dưk tol tahli ji tol vari, tơơk ti akoh kơy tok plêêk <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />ji paleek bơơn yal Kơy riirh dong truh đơơy đơơy, miet miet, laa Kơy heq panưk jêêk plêêk kung tôôy thưq tol plêêk, vari kung tôôy thưq tol vari, ji tahli kung tôôy thưq đom tahli, đaneq: “Hnoq paq măn e kawat leq đnoyq. <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Bơh muut kaluh hngơy e hnưm ku yaak plêêk thưq pơh, tuôôy kơy nưq jeq klôôp keeng, yôôych varơuq kadook ku Kơy Plêêk hnoq jah jêêk yuôôr, dang đaji Kadraq heq đnooy vlôh hêêl hlah nưq ka xapok Kadraq laa khơl hlit.” <verse eid="REV 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Yôôch apok đơu gô tameng xing plêêk laay xanoh dii gô, đaneq: “Dayh hooy, xok rahlăp jơyq heq luh vlôh đom ti ku yaak plêêk đong dưk tol tahli ji tol vari.” <verse eid="REV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Nưq laa gô truh dii yaak plêêk nưq, đnooy kơy nưq ăm ka gô rahlăp jơyq de. Yaak plêêk nưq dăt gô: “Dayh nhonq xok ji xa ni yơu, yôôch ni hnoq khienq klaak ay biq pahlăk, bơh đom huuy ay, ni hnoq ngưưm đaji daak hluut.” <verse eid="REV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Gô nhonq xok rahlăp jơyq de xing ti ku yaak plêêk ji xa ni, ni măn đom huuy gô ngưưm đaji daak hluut, đơu tuôôy gô heq xa ni, klaak gô biq pahlăk. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Yôôch 'ngưng apok đnooy dii gô: “Ay duh pheq đnooy hlit yưk tra truh 'ngưng tamooy, 'ngưng daak dêh, kaluh apok thêêk, ji vuua padrok.”<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Atêq nưq, muuyq gay kadeer dang đaji gay wolh heq jah ăm ka gô, tuôôy e apok xanoh: “Dayh dưk tok ji wolh hnhư hơu ku Kơy Plêêk ji para hơu, dii khơl dro ayuôôt laat đom nưq. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Măn truh chaal, laa phon pi gôk hnhư hơu, dayh xôq hlê, te wolh ni, vii ni heq biq pahnăp ka khơl tamooy daak kadrơy, ji oot hnoq joaq jalon theng vah đom poot kưl vaarq xiêk. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Yôôch Gô hnoq ăm xôq vaarq dro xanưk ku Gô, ji oot hnoq đnooy hlit đom muuyq ravơu vaarq hreek drơu kưl hngơy, tuôôy măn hlưp aau vaayh taat.” <verse eid="REV 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Vaarq dro xanưk neq laa vaarq ưk ô liu ji vaarq jôôk đen dưk kangưưr Lôôk ku vari. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Atoh kơyq xung dơơp haiq baarq, yôôych ôôlh vlôh xing huuy baarq yôôch vuh kaxêêt khơl tachơơl baarq, lunưq atoh adro leq xung dơơp haiq baarq, yôôych adro nưq pheq biq păk kaxêêt đanưq. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Baarq e qwuyen kađnoch plêêk hlê xôq leh e jit rôh pôôt đom kaluh hngơy tyauq apok hlit ku baarq, ji baarq e qwuyen tol kaluh alook daak xôq dơơp daak jêêk vlôh vahaap ji xôq dơơp haiq vari bơơn đu thưq pơơl dal, muut paq kê tuôôy leq baarq trôôch. <verse eid="REV 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Tuôôy baarq heq payôôch apok xanưk ku baarq, yôôych poop ôô hooy tok xing huuk leh e kalek hnoq tagay tahmơt tachơơl kung baarq, ji ni hnoq jay iaq baarq yôôch păk kaxêêt baarq hloay. <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />Xaak ku baarq hnoq padoh tol trôôk kôt ku theng kôt (laa theng jah taayh đom long lơuq laa Sô-đôm ji Ai Kâp), kung laa aduq đơu Lôôk ku baarq heq biq đongq đing tol gay charăk. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Đom pe hngơy rưưyh, manih xing loch kaluh tamooy, kaluh palơy tamooy, kaluh apok athêêk ji kaluh daak dêh raay 'yo xaak ku baarq ji oot leh ăm pheep kaluh xaak ku baarq jah up đom xanưng. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Manih araak tol vari hlah hlaak truh baarq ji xa mưng, oot hnoq atăq kadrool ka mamuuyq vii vaarq kơy hlit nưq heq dơơp ka manih araak tol vari pơơl hwơơl. <verse eid="REV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Yôôch atêq pe hngơy rưưyh, hoot heet varơuq riirh xing Kơy Plêêk nhôp muut đom baarq, ji baarq dưk tok tol jôôk baarq, nưq laa varơuq varaal yôq thier kôt apôôt tol khơl adro 'yo hloq baarq. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Yôôch baarq tek muuyq apok kôt xing plêêk, xanoh dii baarq: “Dayh tok đnen!” Nưq laa baarq hooy tok plêêk đom muuyq đum kluk, ji khơl adro tachơơl ku baarq raay 'yo hloq baarq. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Muut wat nưq, muuyq đơơt ahrưng vari kôt xalih vlôh, ji muuyq phon kưl ku theng hrưp pôôt. Đom đơơt ahrưng vari, yal ku pơh ravơu manih biq kaxêêt, ji khơl adro măn riirh hlê jêêk vlôh varaal yôq đơu tơơk tưp tađnah tađnaak atok ka Kơy Plêêk tol plêêk.<verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Varơuq pơơl dal thưq vaarq heq yôôch. 'Yo hơq, varơuq pơơl dal thưq pe đong truh kach thier talăng.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Kơy yaak plêêk thưq pơh klôôp keeng, yôôych kaluh apok đnooy kôt ahna vlôh xing tol plêêk, đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:15">“Daak dêh ku dêh araak heq jêêk vlôh daak dêh ku Lôôk haay ji Kơy Chiuq Para Jơu ku Kadraq.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:15">Kadraq hnoq dưk xakaq dong truh đơơy đơơy, miet miet.”<verse eid="REV 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Yôôch vaarq kưl poot khơl draq đong 'ngôôy tol ngaai ku oot kangưưr Kơy Plêêk, heq kul mot oot pôôt ji ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />tơơl:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:17">“Kuh Lôôk laa Kơy Plêêk, Kơy Taay Yaak, Kơy juneq e ji heq e, 'wot kuh kway Kadraq</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:17">vii Kadraq heq adrơk jư taay yaak kôt galơh ku Kadraq ji dưk xakaq. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Muuyq sôôq rahlăp đok: </char><char style="fqa">Plêêk dưk xakaq kaluh araak, Kơy juneq e, heq e, ji hnoq truh, </char> bơh đa sôôq kaluh rahlăp đơơu neq be đok đanưq. </note><verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Kaluh daak tôq jaraq,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">đơu đơơt tôq jaraq ku Kadraq heq truh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">ji katuôôy ka khơl adro kaxêêt biq xưh xadrah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">kung kahniq kadrool ka khơl xapok Kadraq,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">'ngưq laa khơl hlit ji khơl vah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">kung khơl dro kul yôq yal Kadraq,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">khơl de hloay khơl kôt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">ji păk kaxêêt dêq khơl adro đong păk kaxêêt dêq vari.”<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Yôôch hnhư hơu ku Kơy Plêêk măn tol plêêk jah luh vlôh ji vook tavek ku Lôôk jah 'yo hloq đom hnhư hơu Kadraq. Atêq nưq, e kaluh ka'mek xađnek, kaluh hnưm garung garung, ji hnưm kơy kata ahna, muuyq đơơt ahrưng vari kung đơơt jit parier kôt.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Yôôch muuyq dơuq akêh kôt jah nhonq hloq măn tol plêêk: muuyq khơl kadrê hlưp tok xăk mot hngơy, ji xiêk măn 'laarq jôôk mư, dii muuyq đoat tađnah kưl vaarq poop xalok tol akoq mư, <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />ji vii đong măn bonq, mư alo ook đom đơơt jiq pa iir, ji đong jiq takoot klaak xôq pa iir. <verse eid="REV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Ji muuyq dơuq akêh kadrơy jah nhonq hloq tol plêêk: 'Yo hơq, muuyq ôô vayaa kôt phôôm dôôp e pơh akoq, kưl akê, dii pơh đoat tađnah tol kaluh akoq ku ni. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Hlooy ku ni ahwoa muuyq phon pe kaluh xalok tol plêêk yôôch taweek kaluh xalok pôôt vari. Yôôch ôô vayaa dưk kangưưr khơl kadrê jeq pa iir, xôq tuôôy mư pa iir yôôych ni hnoq luôôt xok koot ku mư. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Mư pa iir muuyq koot kanau, oh de laa dro hnoq dưk xakaq tôôy daak dêh bơơn gay katôôlh maam. Yôôch koot ku mư jah varoh xok ka Kơy Plêêk ji truh aduq ngaai Kadraq, <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />măn khơl kadrê yôôych xadăk klôônq muut wăngq we, aduq đơu mư e muuyq kachô jah Kơy Plêêk ralauq 'miêh aduq nưq, xôq e khơl manih văch xiap mư măn aduq nưq đom muuyq ravơu vaarq hreek drơu kưl hngơy.<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Yôôch e muuyq đơơt tahmơt tol plêêk. Mi-ka-ên ji khơl yaak plêêk ku kơy tahmơt dii ôô vayaa; ji ôô vayaa kung kaluh kamuuych xơk ni tahmơt hlê. <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />Anưq yôôch ni leh đu paraat tachơơl hlê, aduq ka oot kung leh măn jah hloq tol plêêk đnoyq. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Anưq laa ôô vayaa kôt biq taweek pôôt — volh hnu, jah taayh laa kamuuych long Sa-tan, adro pa ôôh aluut dêq dêh araak — ni biq taweek pôôt vari, kaluh kamuuych xơk ku ni kung biq taweek pôôt kung dii ni. <verse eid="REV 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Yôôch gô tek muuyq apok đnooy kôt tol plêêk, đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:10">“Juneq, varơuq wơơt xok, taay yaak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">ji daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk haay heq truh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">kung dii qwuyen da uh ku Kơy Chiuq Para Jơu ku Kadraq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:10">bơyh vii adro kienq xadrah oh ay ku haay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">laa adro klôôy hngơy kienq xadrah oot kangưưr Kơy Plêêk haay, heq biq taweek pôôt.<verse eid="REV 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Oot heq jay iaq ni gamưh vahaap Trưưu Koot ji gamưh apok dơơp xanưk ku oot,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:11">oot be alay xăk riirh oot dong truh kaxêêt.<verse eid="REV 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Vii kơq nưq, dayh hlah hlaak tok, nee kaluh tưng plêêk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">kung khơl adro măn đom nưq!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:12">Ra ơơh hloay ka vari ji tahli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">vii kamuuych heq pôôt aduq êêp,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 12:12">tuôôy đong e đơơt jaraq paq ik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">vii ni xet ni măn thier axit kawat!”<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Tuôôy ôô vayaa nhonq vlôh đaneq ni heq biq taweek pôôt vari, yôôych ni chawiq tyauq khơl kadrê, laa manih heq pa iir koot kanau hơq. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Yôôch vaarq panưr ku xêêp kalaak kôt jah kahniq ka khơl kadrê nưq xôq mư tapol truh aduq wăngq we, truh aduq ku mư, aduq đơu mư jah văch xiap kađnư đom muuyq kawah, kaluh kawah, ji panoot kawah — kach xangưưy mot volh. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Nưq laa volh phuun daak vlôh xing đom huuy ni đaji daak tavook tyauq atêq khơl kadrê, xôq ni hnoq ik khienq mư biq daak kôt đôôk hooy. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Yôôch vari wơơt waak khơl kadrê, vari hah huuy ji luôôt apoop daak tavook đơu ôô vayaa heq phuun vlôh xing huuy ni. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Anưq laa ôô vayaa tôq jaraq dii khơl kadrê yôôch ni vlôh hooy tagay tahmơt dii phon măn hlê đom koot xau ku mư, laa khơl dro tameng jư ganeen ku Kơy Plêêk ji e apok xanưk ku Lôôk Jê-xu. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Yôôch ni dưk tol choah aduq gah tahli. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Muuyq sôôq rahlăp xôq apok neq măn adroyq 13:1, bơh kaluh rahlăp đangq tuôq dik xôq ni măn đnen dơơp 12:18. </char></note><verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Atêq nưq, gô hloq muuyq poop ôô hooy tok klơlh tahli, e kưl akê ji pơh akoq, ji tol kaluh akê ku ni laa kưl đoat tađnah, đơu tol kaluh akoq ku ni laa muuyq yal katơơk galơh. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Poop ôô đơu gô hloq yôôych dang đaji ôô beeo, pla jôôk ku ni dang đaji ku ôô xagơu, măn huuy ni yôôych dang huuy ôô vomq, ji ôô vayaa pahnăp paraat kalh vayaa ka ni, kung dii ngaai ni ji qwuyen da uh thier kôt. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Muuyq đom kaluh akoq ku ni dang đaji heq hmưq biq hmơt tiel truh kaxêêt, đơu hlêêl xưr xôôh jeq kaxêêt ku ni heq jah payơh. Dêq ka vari raay dơơp akêh đơu hooy tyauq ôô nưq, <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />ji oot kuh ayuôôt ôô vayaa vii ni heq kahniq qwuyen da uh ka ôô, oot kung kuh ayuôôt ôô, đaneq: “Kơyq dang đaji ôô, ji kơyq hnoq ik tahmơt tachơơl hlê ni ik?” <verse eid="REV 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Muuyq poop huuy đnooy apok xơk lar ji đnooy katơơk galơh jah kahniq ka ôô, qwuyen da uh kung jah kahniq ka ni xôq dưk dơơp đom poot kưl vaarq xiêk. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Nưq laa ôô luh huuy ni đnooy kaluh apok katơơk galơh tachơơl hlê Kơy Plêêk, đnooy ra ơơh yal Kadraq ji raap đơ ku Kadraq — khơl manih măn tol plêêk. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Ôô ik pheep tagay tahmơt dii khơl vah ji jay iaq oot, qwuyen da uh kung jah kahniq ka ni tol tôôy adrơơk, kaluh tamooy, apok athêêk ji daak dêh. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Tôôy manih araak tol vari hnoq kuh ayuôôt ni, laa dêq hloay kơyq đơu anơng ku adro nưq heq leh jah valơk đom Rahlăp Varơuq Riirh ku Trưưu Koot, Kơy heq biq păk kaxêêt, xing tuôôy panưk jêêk dêh araak. <verse eid="REV 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />Atoh kơyq e tôôr, yôôych dayh tameng.<verse eid="REV 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Atoh kơyq deng ka varơuq rôp dơơp xapok,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">dro nưq dik pheq hooy trôôk neq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 13:10">atoh kơyq hnoq biq păk kaxêêt bơyh xieh jaauq,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">dro nưq pheq biq păk kaxêêt bơyh xieh jaauq.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 13:10">Neq laa varơuq atuq xuum chiuq uunq ji xuum tuôq ku khơl vah.<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Yôôch gô hloq muuyq poop ôô kadrơy hooy tok klơlh vari, ji ni e vaarq akê dang đaji ôô trưưu koot, đơu ni xathêêk đaji ôô vayaa. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Ni xok dơơp tôôy qwuyen da uh ku ôô thưq nhưk kangưưr ôô nưq, ji ni dưk dơơp qwuyen neq dơơp aleq ka vari kung manih araak tol vari hnoq kuh ayuôôt ôô thưq nhưk, 'ngưq laa ôô e hlêêl xưr jeq kaxêêt heq jah payơh. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Ni dưk dơơp kaluh dơuq akêh kôt galơh, truh nôôy ni pheq đnooy hnoq ik khienq ka ôôlh klêh xing tol plêêk pôôt vari hloay kangưưr koot manih. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Bơơn kaluh dơuq akêh đơu ni jah pheep dơơp kangưưr ôô, ni pa ôôh aluut koot manih tol vari, tuôôy dăt koot manih tol vari dơơp muuyq vangưl ôô e hlêêl xưr xôôh bơyh xieh đơu măn riirh. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Ni ik pheep kahniq hơơy hoot heet ka vangưl nưq ku ôô, xôq vangưl ôô pheq đnooy đnooy ik, ji khienq dro leq leh kuh ayuôôt vangưl ôô pheq biq păk kaxêêt. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Ni kung khienq tôôy dro, de kung đaji kôt, karoh kung đaji adrah, rayơh rayơơy hloay xapok, dơơp aleq hnoq ik ăm ka oot muuyq dơuq hlêêl tol pla ti akoh ku oot long tol ngưưl oot, <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />xôq be e paq kê kơyq hnoq ik root long tek ik atoh dro nưq leh e dơuq hlêêl nưq, laa anơng ku ôô, long sôôq ku anơng ni. <verse eid="REV 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Varơuq khôôt xet laa neq: Kơyq e varơuq hlolh xet, dro nưq dayh jauq sôôq ku ôô. Vii ni laa sôôq ku muuyq dro, ji sôôq ku ni laa drơu hreek drơu kưl drơu.<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Yôôch gô 'yo hloq, ji hơq, Trưưu Koot dưk tol đoot Si-ôn, ji kung dii Kadraq laa muuyq hreek poot kưl poot ravơu dro e yal Kadraq ji yal Vaq Kadraq jah valơk tol ngưưl ku oot. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Ji gô tameng apok đnooy xing tol plêêk đaji hnưm garung garung ku 'ngưng alook daak, đaji hnưm kơy kata kalh, ji hnưm gô heq tameng yôôych dang đaji khơl manih parayh varo haak oot. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Oot kacheeu muuyq baai kacheeu đơơu kangưưr ngaai ji kangưưr poot poop ôô kung khơl draq, đơu be kơyq hnoq ik hok xet baai kacheeu nưq đêh vlôh muuyq hreek poot kưl poot ravơu dro heq jah wơơt root xing tol vari. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Neq laa khơl manih koq biq klơơr 'yêq dii khơl drê, vii oot laa khơl manih măn tadăp. Neq laa khơl manih hooy tyauq Trưưu Koot aduq leq đơu Kadraq hooy. Khơl dro neq heq jah root xing katul koot manih đaji play adroyq dik ka Kơy Plêêk ji ka Trưưu Koot, <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />be e apok pa ôôh lar leq jah axek hloq aduq huuy oot, vii oot leh e hlêêl tachoot. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Muuyq sôôq rahlăp hnu iaq athêêp: </char><char style="fqa">kangưưr ngaai Kơy Plêêk</char>.</note><verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Yôôch gô hloq muuyq yaak plêêk kadrơy tapol aduq katul plêêk, e Hêêl Kaxay đơơy đơơy xôq đnooy avlôh ka koot manih tol vari — hloay kaah ka tôôy daak dêh, adrơơk, apok thêêk ji kaluh tamooy — <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />taayh kôt apok: “Dayh kul yôq Kơy Plêêk ji tơơk tưp tađnah tađnaak ka Kadraq, vii wat xưh xadrah ku Kadraq heq truh. Dayh kuh ayuôôt Kơy panưk jêêk plêêk, vari, tahli ji kaluh alook daak.”<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Muuyq kơy kadrơy, yaak plêêk thưq vaarq, tyauq atêq, đnooy đaneq: “Ni gưlh hrưp yôôch, Ba-bi-lôn kôt heq gưlh hrưp, 'ngưq laa adro ahluk ahlul dêq hloay kaluh daak dêh hôôch xing aduq lok tôq dayh truh varơuq apuq atrăp ku ni.”<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Muuyq yaak plêêk kadrơy, kơy thưq pe, tyauq atêq oot, đnooy kôt apok, đaneq: “Atoh adro leq kuh ayuôôt ôô kung vangưl ni, ji nhonq hlêêl dơuq tol ngưưl long tol ti adro nưq, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />yôôych adro nưq kung hnoq hôôch lok tôq dayh ku Kơy Plêêk, laa thưq lok leh wa cheet muut dooy tôq jaraq ku Kadraq, ji adro nưq hnoq biq dơơp jiq jiêh bơơn ôôlh ji lưưu hwinh kangưưr khơl yaak plêêk vah ji kangưưr Trưưu Koot. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />'Nhuuy xing aduq jiq jiêh ku oot tapol tok dong truh đơơy đơơy, miet miet, ji oot be e varơuq padơy pado ka hngơy hloay ka klôôy, 'ngưq laa khơl adro kuh ayuôôt ôô kung vangưl ni, ji dro leq nhonq xok hlêêl dơuq anơng ku ni. <verse eid="REV 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Neq laa varơuq atuq xuum chiuq uunq ku khơl vah, khơl manih tameng jư kaluh ganeen ku Kơy Plêêk ji xuum tuôq aduq Lôôk Jê-xu.”<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Gô tameng muuyq apok đnooy xing plêêk, đaneq: “Dayh valơk: Xing neng kơn atêq, vanong ka adro kaxêêt laa adro kaxêêt đom Lôôk.” Kơy Phool Hiel xanoh: “Jơq, xôq oot hnoq padơy pado klơlh kaluh galeh galal ku oot, vii kaluh varơuq dơơp ku oot tyauq atêq kung dii oot.”<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Yôôch gô 'yo hloq, ji hơq, muuyq đum kluk ko, ji măn tol kluk laa kơyq nưq dang Koot Manih, e đoat tađnah bơơn vajang tol akoq Kadraq, ji muuyq poop lahaay mưr đom ti Kadraq. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Yôôch muuyq yaak plêêk kadrơy hooy vlôh xing hnhư hơu, kôt apok taayh Kơy đong 'ngôôy tol kluk: “Xiin palo lahaay Kadraq vlôh ji goch, vii kawat xôq goch heq truh vii muua goch tol vari heq dôôp.” <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Nưq laa Kơy 'ngôôy tol kluk raheeng lahaay Kadraq tol vari, ji vari biq goch.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Yôôch muuyq yaak plêêk kadrơy hooy vlôh xing hnhư hơu tol plêêk, kơy neq kung e muuyq poop lahaay mưr. <verse eid="REV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Muuyq yaak plêêk kadrơy đnoyq, laa kơy e qwuyen da uh tol ôôlh, vlôh xing para hơu, ji kơy kalh apok taayh kơy e poop lahaay mưr, đaneq: “Dayh palo lahaay mưr kơy vlôh, ji goch xok kaluh 'môôk nho xing kaluh ưk nho 'laarq vari, vii kaluh 'môôk nho ku oot heq dôôp.” <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Anưq laa kơy yaak plêêk raheeng lahaay kơy pôôt vari ji goch xok hluôôt nho 'laarq vari, yôôch taweek muut thung raniaq nho kôt ku đơơt tôq dayh ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Thung raniaq nho jah joaq pi gôk theng ji vahaap đom thung raniaq nưq ahngok vlôh yơơt tok truh moon ôô ahleh, yơơt xangưưy muuyq ravơu drơu hreek êt-ta-đơ.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Yôôch gô hloq muuyq dơuq kôt ji akêh kadrơy tol plêêk: pơh yaak plêêk đong jư pơh pơơl dal, kaluh varơuq lôôch dik, vii đơơt tôq dayh ku Kơy Plêêk jah xaleep aduq oot.<verse eid="REV 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Gô kung hloq kajoq nưq dang đaji tahli bơơn ramil jah aluq dii ôôlh. Khơl adro jay iaq ôô, iaq vangưl ni, ji iaq sôôq ku anơng ni, đong dưk tol tahli ramil, adrơk varo haak ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />Oot kacheeu baai kacheeu ku Môi-se, xapok ku Kơy Plêêk, ji baai kacheeu ku Trưưu Koot, đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:3">“Kuh Lôôk laa Kơy Plêêk, Kơy Taay Yaak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">kaluh varơuq dơơp Kadraq kôt galơh ji akêh.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:3">Kuh Vuua ku kaluh đơơy xanưm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">trôôk daak Kadraq laa hyioh jăk ji dong dik. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Muuyq sôôq rahlăp đok: </char><char style="fqa">kaluh tamooy </char> thêq ka <char style="fq">kaluh đơơy xanưm</char>.</note><verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Kuh Lôôk, kơyq be biq varaal yôq,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">ji hnoq leh ayuôôt laat yal Kadraq?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:4">Vii vơ muuyq Kadraq laa vah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">Bơyh dêq hloay kaluh daak dêh hnoq truh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">ji ayuôôt laat kangưưr Kadraq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:4">vii kaluh varơuq hyioh jăk ku Kadraq heq jah kahnoq vlôh.”<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Atêq kaluh varơuq nưq, gô 'yo hloq, hnhư hơu ku raap xanưk tavek tol plêêk jah luh vlôh. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Pơh yaak plêêk adrơk pơh pơơl dal hooy vlôh xing hnhư hơu, đom qwuân aau bơơn vaayh lanh xarêh xaraat, tađnah ploat, ji jah hnek talơy bơơn vajang rawiit tada. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Yôôch muuyq đom poot poop ôô ăm ka pơh yaak plêêk pơh dooy bơơn vajang tađnưk viik varơuq tôq dayh ku Kơy Plêêk, Kơy riirh dong truh đơơy đơơy, miet miet. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Hnhư hơu khul galik 'nhuuy jo tađnah tađnaak ku Kơy Plêêk ji jo taay yaak Kadraq, be kơyq hnoq ik muut đom hnhư hơu dong truh tuôôy pơh pơơl dal ku pơh kơy yaak plêêk jah payôôch.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Yôôch gô tameng muuyq apok kôt xing hnhư hơu đnooy dii pơh yaak plêêk: “Dayh hooy ji uk pơh dooy tôq dayh ku Kơy Plêêk pôôt vari.”<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Nưq laa kơy thưq nhưk hooy ji uk dooy kơy pôôt vari, yôôych ple talook ramêq ji dơơp jiq jiêh xalih vlôh tol oot, khơl adro e dơuq hlêêl ku ôô, kung khơl adro kuh ayuôôt vangưl ni.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Yôôch kơy thưq vaarq uk dooy kơy pôôt tahli, yôôych tahli jêêk vlôh vahaap, đaji ku manih kaxêêt, ji tôôy paroh riirh đom tahli raay kaxêêt.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Atêq nưq, kơy thưq pe uk dooy kơy pôôt kaluh daak tavook ji alook daak, yôôych daak jêêk vlôh vahaap. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Gô tameng yaak plêêk ku daak đnooy:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 16:5">“Kuh Kơy đong e ji heq e, laa Kơy Vah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:5">Kadraq laa hyioh jăk vii Kadraq heq xưh xadrah kaluh varơuq neq. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Muuyq sôôq rahlăp đok: </char><char style="fqa">Wơơy Lôôk, Kơy đong e, heq e, ji măn e, Kadraq dik hyioh jăk vii Kadraq heq xưh xadrah kaluh varơuq nưq</char>.</note><verse eid="REV 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Vii oot heq dơơp kahrôq vahaap ku khơl vah ji khơl hlit,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:6">lunưq Kadraq heq ăm oot hôôch vahaap;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 16:6">oot dik đangq đanưq.”<verse eid="REV 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Yôôch gô tameng para hơu đnooy: “Jơq, kuh Lôôk laa Kơy Plêêk, Kơy Taay Yaak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:7">kaluh varơuq xưh xadrah ku Kadraq raay dong dik ji hyioh jăk.”<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Yôôch kơy thưq poot uk dooy kơy tol mot hngơy, yôôych ni ik pheep vuh khơl drơy bơơn ôôlh. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Anưq laa oot biq vuh jaq vii xal tôq paq ik, ji oot đnooy katơơk galơh yal ku Kơy Plêêk, Kơy e qwuyen tol kaluh pơơl dal neq, đơu oot be chiuq wiit xuum xôq tưp tađnah tađnaak ka Kadraq.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Yôôch kơy thưq dăp uk dooy kơy tol ngaai ku ôô, yôôych daak dêh ni jêêk vlôh kamơng jaluk, ji oot kek kapiet oot vii jiq jiêh. <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />Oot đnooy katơơk galơh Kơy Plêêk tol plêêk vii varơuq jiq jiêh oot ji vii kaluh hlêêl buk katôôch ku oot, anưq đơu oot leh wiit xuum truh kaluh varơuq dơơp ku oot.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Yôôch kơy thưq drơu uk dooy kơy pôôt daak tavook kôt Ơ-phơ-rat, yôôych daak tavook biq kateh hriet xôq trôôk hooy ku khơl vuua xing pi mot hngơy vlok jah 'meq 'miêh. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Gô hloq vlôh xing huuy ôô vayaa, xing huuy ôô, ji xing huuy hlit pa ôôh, e pe kamuuych klơl 'yêq dang đaji aji, <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Vii oot laa garu xi ku kaluh kamuuych dưk dơơp 'ngưng dơuq akêh, đơu oot truh dii khơl vuua tol dêq dêh araak xôq anguk hlê oot ka varơuq tahmơt muut hngơy kôt ku Kơy Plêêk, Kơy Taay Yaak. <verse eid="REV 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />(“'Yo hơq! Gô truh đaji adro atôk! Vanong ka dro parol takôô ji jư 'yo aau yơơt ni, xôq ni leh tawaak hooy lalôk đơu khơl drơy 'yo hloq varơuq kamưưl ku ni.”) <verse eid="REV 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Oot anguk tagumq oot hlê măn aduq jah taayh laa Ha-ma-gê-đôn đom apok Hi-baq-lai.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Yôôch kơy thưq pơh uk dooy kơy muut không khiq, yôôych muuyq apok đnooy kôt xing ngaai đom hnhư hơu ahna vlôh, đaneq: “Varơuq heq payôôch!” <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Nưq laa e ka'mek tađnah, hnưm garung garung kung hnưm kơy kata, ji muuyq đơơt ahrưng vari kôt xalih vlôh, đơơt ahrưng vari nưq thier kalh ji kôt truh mưk muuyq đơơt đanưq koq hmưq xalih vlôh xing tuôôy koot manih e tol vari. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Theng kôt biq aklah vlôh dơơp pe phon, ji kaluh theng kôt ku kaluh daak dêh hrưp pôôt, ji Ba-bi-lôn kôt biq văch hlê kangưưr Kơy Plêêk xôq ăm ka ni dooy lok tôq dayh rahưk rahưk ku Kadraq. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Yôôch kaluh ngok tahli raay xadăk klôônq, ji kaluh ngok đoot be jah axek hloq. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Kaluh kuk jit parier kôt kơh muuyq ta-lâng xing plêêk klêh pôôt tol koot manih, yôôch oot đnooy katơơk galơh Kơy Plêêk bơyh pơơl dal jit parier, vii pơơl dal nưq thier laa parêq parơh dik.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Yôôch muuyq đom pơh yaak plêêk adrơk pơh poop dooy, hooy truh ji đnooy dii gô, đaneq: “Truh đnen nee, gô hnoq ăm ay hloq varơuq xưh xadrah mư xakwoah kôt đong 'ngôôy tol 'ngưng alook daak, <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />đơu kung dii ni, khơl vuua tol vari heq lôp kadrôôp apuq atrăp, măn manih araak tol vari yôôych vuul weel bơyh lok apuq atrăp ku ni.” <verse eid="REV 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Kơy nưq taway gô hooy đom Kơy Phool Hiel truh muuyq wăngq we, yôôch gô hloq muuyq khơl kadrê 'ngôôy tol ôô phôôm dôôp rưk, e viik kaluh yal taayh katơơk galơh, e pơh akoq ji kưl akê. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Dro khơl drê nưq yôôych hlưp qwuân aau phôôm tôô ji dôôp rưk, jah pagooh dii vajang, phơu quiq, ji kalook châu, tol ti ni đong adrơk muuyq dooy bơơn vajang viik kaluh thưq ramêq ji kaluh varơuq klơơr 'yêq bơyh varơuq apuq atrăp ku ni, <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />măn tol ngưưl ni jah valơk muuyq yal xưng: “Ba-bi-lôn kadook padu kôt galơh, miq ku bing apuq atrăp ji kaluh thưq ramêq ku vari.” <verse eid="REV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Yôôch gô hloq adro khơl kadrê nưq đong vuul weel dii vahaap ku khơl vah ji dii vahaap khơl manih dơơp xanưk ku Lôôk Jê-xu, đơu atêq tuôôy 'yo hloq mư nưq, gô thier akêh dii varơuq tưng hưng paq ik. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Kơy yaak plêêk đnooy dii gô: “Vii aleq ay laay akêh? Gô hnoq đnooy ka ay truh kadook padu ku khơl kadrê ji ku ôô đong acho mư nưq, 'ngưq laa ôô e pơh akoq ji kưl akê. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Ôô đơu ay hloq adroyq heq e, juneq leh e, đơu laay jeq hooy tok xing huuk leh e kalek, yôôych ni hnoq hooy truh aduq kaxêêt hlơơp, măn koot manih tol vari, đơu anơng oot leh jah valơk đom Rahlăp Varơuq Riirh xing tuôôy panưk jêêk plêêk vari, hnoq akêh tuôôy 'yo hloq ôô vii adroyq heq e, juneq leh e, yôôch hnoq truh. <verse eid="REV 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />Tuôôy xuum biit e varơuq khôôt xet đom varơuq neq: Pơh akoq laa pơh ngok đoot, aduq khơl kadrê hơq 'ngôôy tol oot, ji oot laa pơh kơy vuua; <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />dăp vuua heq hrưp, muuyq vuua đong măn hlê, muuyq vuua kadrơy măn koq truh. Ji tuôôy ni truh, ni vơ măn hlê đom muuyq kawat lêq. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Ôô adroyq heq e đơu juneq leh e, yôôych jơq ni laa kơy vuua thưq thơơm; đơu ni thuôk xuq pơh vuua hơq, ji đong hooy truh aduq kaxêêt hlơơp. <verse eid="REV 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />Kưl poop akê đơu ay hloq laa kưl vuua, khơl adro koq nhonq jah daak dêh, bơh oot hnoq nhonq jah qwuyen dơơp vuua đom muuyq wat kung dii ôô. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Khơl vuua neq e kung muuyq xuum biit, ji oot ăm paraat kalh kung qwuyen da uh ku oot ka ôô. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Oot hnoq tagay tahmơt dii Trưưu koot, yôôch Trưưu Koot hnoq jah jay oot vii Kadraq laa Lôôk ku khơl lôôk, Vuua ku khơl vuua — ji kung dii Kadraq laa khơl dro jah tawooyh taayh, jah rơơlh xok, ji muuyq xuum.” <verse eid="REV 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Kơy yaak plêêk đnooy dii gô: “Kaluh alook daak đơu ay hloq, aduq đơu mư xakwoah đong 'ngôôy, laa kaluh tamooy, bing manih karôp, kaluh daak dêh ji kaluh apok athêêk. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Kưl poop akê đơu ay hloq, kung ôô — oot hnoq 'yarơ geet mư xakwoah nưq, yôôch oot hnoq dơơp ni biq varoh xok ji lalôk, oot hnoq xa luôôt hlek ni, ji hnoq vuh ka'lăk ni bơơn ôôlh, <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />vii Kơy Plêêk heq ăm xôq muut xuum oot xôq dơơp iq đinq ku Kadraq, xôq dưk dơơp muuyq iq đinq, ji xôq ăm daak dêh oot ka ôô dong truh tuôôy kaluh apok ku Kơy Plêêk hnoq jah jêêk yuôôr dêq hloay. <verse eid="REV 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />Khơl kadrê đơu ay hloq laa theng kôt e qwuyen xakaq tol khơl vuua ku vari.”<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Atêq kaluh varơuq nưq gô hloq muuyq yaak plêêk kadrơy kahri pôôt xing plêêk, e qwuyen da uh thier kôt, ji vari jah xaraar tađnah bơyh tađnah tađnaak ku kơy nưq. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Dii apok đnooy găk ra aal, yaak plêêk nưq taayh kôt, đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:2">“Ba-bi-lôn kôt gưlh hrưp yôôch!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">Ni heq jêêk vlôh aduq măn ku kaluh kamuuych,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">aduq du klôônq ku kaluh garu xi klơơr 'yêq,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">ji aduq du klôônq ku kaluh paroh xêêp a'moh nhơy, đangq ramêq.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Muuyq sôôq rahlăp đok: </char><char style="fqa">hrưp lalaak yôôch, hrưp lalaak yôôch</char>.</note><verse eid="REV 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Vii dêq hloay kaluh daak dêh heq vuul weel bơyh lok tôq jaraq truh varơuq apuq atrăp ku ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">khơl vuua tol vari heq lôp kadrôôp apuq atrăp dii ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">khơl tabôôt xa tol vari heq karoh tok gamưh paraat kalh aduq đơơy riirh xa agưt ku ni.”<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Yôôch gô tameng muuyq apok kadrơy xing plêêk xanoh:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:4">“Tamooy gô lơơy, dayh vlôh klơlh ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">xôq khơl koot klơlh tajinq muut kaluh kadrôôp maroh ku ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">ji xôq khơl koot klơlh pheq chiuq aduq kaluh pơơl dal ku ni.<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />Vii kadrôôp ku ni heq pahloot tok truh tol plêêk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">ji Kơy Plêêk heq văch hlê kaluh varơuq dơơp xơk aak ku ni.<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Dayh dơơp dii ni kung đaji ni heq dơơp,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">ji dayh bla hlê gôp vaarq yưk, 'ngưng gôp vaarq tyauq kaluh varơuq dơơp ku ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">đom dooy đơu ni heq aluq, dayh aluq ka ni 'ngưng gôp vaarq.<verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Ni heq kadih 'yo tơơk ni ji riirh xa agưt đaleq,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">yôôych dayh ăm ka ni varơuq jiq jiêh ji hlu rơu đanưq.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:7">Vii ni đnooy đom xuum ni, đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">‘Gô xa 'ngôôy đaji muuyq mo vuua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">gô leh aalq laa mo valơu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">ji gô hnoq be e 'leq hmưq tavơh varơuq nhim alo.’<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Vii kơq nưq, đom muuyq hngơy, kaluh pơơl dal ku ni hnoq ka ôp truh:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">kaxêêt hlơơp, nhim alo, pangoot hrah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:8">ji ni hnoq biq vuh ka'lăk bơơn ôôlh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">vii Lôôk laa Kơy Plêêk, Kơy xưh xadrah ni, laa Kơy taay yaak.”<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Khơl vuua tol vari, laa khơl adro lôp kadrôôp apuq atrăp ji riirh xa agưt dii ni, hnoq nhim alo ji alo ook truh ni tuôôy oot hloq 'nhuuy vuh jaq ni, <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Tuôôy dưk xing xangưưy vii varaal yôq varơuq hmơt dook ku ni, đnooy:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:10">“Ra ơơh hloay, ra ơơh hloay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:10">ka theng kôt, Ba-bi-lôn, theng thier kôt kalh!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:10">Vii đom muuyq wat, varơuq xưh xadrah may heq truh.”<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Yôôch khơl tabôôt xa tol vari nhim ook ji hlu rơu ka ni, vii paq măn kơyq root valong đôô ku oot đnoyq — <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />đôô bơơn vajang, baak, phơu quiq, ngok châu, vaayh lanh miim, vaayh tiaq, luuaq laa, vaayh dôôp rưk, ji kaluh thưq gay kahlơu, kaluh đôô bơơn nga ôô kôt, kaluh đôô bơơn gay thier quiq, bơơn đông, bơơn maam, bơơn kâmh thach, <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />kung qwi, bôôt panhưưm, 'nhuuy kahlơu, jarơơu para, kahlơu, lok, jơu, bôôt kway miim, va away, kapiêu bo, trưưu kưưu, ôô ahleh ji xe, kung xapok ji phool hiel khơl drơy. <verse eid="REV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />“Raak play ku ni, varơuq ươk trôôch ku phool hiel, heq chuh xangưưy klơlh ni, tôôy varơuq karoh e ji tađnah tađnưưl heq biq hlơơp klơlh ni, ji oot hnoq paq e dong 'leq jah axek hloq đnoyq.” <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Khơl tabôôt xa ku kaluh thưq đôô neq, laa khơl adro heq jêêk vlôh karoh e, hnoq dưk xing xangưưy klơlh ni, alo nhim ji hlu rơu vii yôq varơuq jiq jiêh ku ni,<verse eid="REV 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:16">“Ra ơơh hloay, ra ơơh hloay ka theng kôt</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">hmưq hlưp vaayh lanh miim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">vaayh tiaq, vaayh dôôp rưk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">ji jah pagooh 'meq bơơn vajang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">phơu quiq, ngok châu,<verse eid="REV 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />vii đom muuyq wat, varơuq karoh e kôt galơh đanưq biq vuh ka'lăk.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 18:17">Tôôy khơl charơơk tau, tôôy manih hooy tau truh aduq leq nưq, khơl dơơp varơuq đom tau, kung khơl adro dơơp ngê tahli raay dưk xing xangưưy, <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />ji alo ook tuôôy 'yo hloq 'nhuuy vuh jaq ku ni, đaneq: “Theng leq đaji theng kôt nưq?” <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Oot paraay thul vari tok akoq oot ji ook tarok, nhim alo, hlu rơu, đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:19">“Ra ơơh hloay, ra ơơh hloay theng kôt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">aduq đơu tôôy manih đom ni e tau ge</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">tol tahli heq jêêk vlôh karoh e gamưh garuh anôôp ni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:19">vii đom muuyq wat, ni heq biq pahyaak ka'lăk.”<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />(“Dayh hlah hlaak truh ni, plêêk lơơy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">kung khơl vah, khơl jah rơơlh ji hnhư hlit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:20">vii Kơy Plêêk heq đnooy vlôh varơuq xưh xadrah ku êêp đôôyq dii ni!”)<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Yôôch muuyq yaak plêêk kalh paraat tơơk kuk phơu dang đaji apal kôt ji taweek pôôt tahli, đnooy:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:21">“Tyauq kach neq, theng kôt Ba-bi-lôn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">hnoq biq taweek kalh pôôt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">ji hnoq paq e 'leq jah 'yo hloq đnoyq,<verse eid="REV 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />hnưm manih parayh varo haak, agưt nhaak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:22">adro klôôp taliaq, ji manih klôôp keeng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">hnoq paq e 'leq tameng tek aduq may đnoyq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:22">tôôy thơq rơơt ti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">hnoq paq e 'leq jah axek hloq aduq may đnoyq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:22">hnưm apal apeh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">hnoq paq e 'leq tameng tek aduq may đnoyq,<verse eid="REV 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />xaraar tađnah đeen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">hnoq paq e 'leq ahnhe tađnah aduq may đnoyq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:23">apok ok ji amưưy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">hnoq paq e 'leq tameng tek aduq may đnoyq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:23">vii khơl tabôôt xa ku may laa khơl adro e qwuyen kôt tol vari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">vii tôôy daak dêh heq biq pa ôôh aluut bơyh đơơp pheep ku may.<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Vahaap ku khơl hlit kung khơl vah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:24">ji ku dêq hloay khơl leq heq biq păk kaxêêt tol vari heq jah axek hloq aduq ni.”<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Atêq kaluh varơuq nưq, gô tameng hnưm dang đaji apok đnooy kôt ku muuyq bing manih thier karôp tol plêêk, đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:1">“Ha-lê-lu-ja!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:1">Varơuq wơơt xok, tađnah tađnaak ji taay yaak thuôk xuq Kơy Plêêk haay,<verse eid="REV 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />vii kaluh varơuq xưh xadrah ku Kadraq laa dong dik ji hyioh jăk,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:2">bơyh Kadraq heq xưh xadrah mo xakwoah kôt</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:2">'ngưq laa adro dơơp va ih va oop vari bơơn katik apuq atrăp ku ni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:2">Kadraq heq bla hlê ka vahaap ku khơl xapok Kadraq</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:2">xing ti ni.”<verse eid="REV 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Yôôch oot đnooy yưk thưq vaarq, đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:3">“Ha-lê-lu-ja!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:3">'Nhuuy xing aduq ni kưq tapol tok dong truh đơơy đơơy, miet miet.”<verse eid="REV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Vaarq kưl poot khơl draq ji poot poop ôô kul xăk pôôt ji kuh ayuôôt Kơy Plêêk, Kơy đong 'ngôôy tol ngaai, đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:4">“Amen. Ha-lê-lu-ja!”<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Muuyq apok đnooy xing ngaai đnooy vlôh, đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:5">“Dayh kacheeu ayuôôt Kơy Plêêk haay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">nee dêq hloay khơl xapok Kadraq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:5">ji khơl dro kul yôq Kadraq,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">khơl de hloay khơl kôt!”<verse eid="REV 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Yôôch gô tameng apok đnooy đaji hnưm ku bing manih thier karôp, dang hnưm ku 'ngưng alook daak, ji dang đaji hnưm kơy kata kalh, đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:6">“Ha-lê-lu-ja!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:6">Vii Lôôk laa Kơy Plêêk ku haay, 'ngưq laa Kơy Taay Yaak, dưk xakaq.<verse eid="REV 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Haay dayh hlah hlaak, luh laak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">ji tơơk tưp tađnah tađnaak tok Kadraq</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:7">vii lêh pajêêk ku Trưưu Koot heq truh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">ji amưưy ku Kadraq heq ralauq xăk xôq 'miêh,<verse eid="REV 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />varơuq jah kahniq ka amưưy nưq laa amưưy jah hlưp aau bơơn vaayh lanh miim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:8">tađnah klưng xarêh xaraat”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 19:8">(Vii vaayh lanh miim laa kaluh varơuq hyioh jăk ku khơl vah.)<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Yôôch yaak plêêk nưq đnooy dii gô: “Dayh valơk: Vanong ka khơl dro jah mơơy jưq waal pajêêk Trưưu Koot.” Kơy nưq kung đnooy dii gô: “Neq laa kaluh apok dong dik ku Kơy Plêêk.” <verse eid="REV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Gô kul pôôt aduq jôôk yaak plêêk nưq xôq kuh ayuôôt kơy, đơu kơy đnooy dii gô: “Te dơơp anưq! Gô laa dro kung dơơp xapok đaji ay ji khơl oh ay ku ay, laa khơl dro e apok xanưk ku Lôôk Jê-xu. Dayh kuh ayuôôt Kơy Plêêk, vii apok xanưk ku Lôôk Jê-xu laa phool hiel ku apok hlit.”<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Yôôch gô hloq plêêk luh vlôh, ji 'yo hơq, muuyq ôô ahleh ko, ji Kơy acho tol ni jah taayh laa jư apok ji dong dik, Kadraq xưh xadrah ji tahmơt tyauq trôôk hyioh jăk. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Mot Kadraq đaji gooy ôôlh, 'ngưng đoat tađnah tol akoq Kadraq, e muuyq yal jah valơk đơu be kơyq xet đêh vlôh vơ Kadraq. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Kadraq hlưp muuyq aau kahliik 'nharuuk đom vahaap, ji yal Kadraq jah taayh laa Apok ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Kaluh bing kuun tol plêêk hooy tyauq Kadraq tol ôô ahleh ko, hlưp vaayh lanh miim ko ji xarêh xaraat. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Muuyq poop xieh thier mưr vlôh xing huuy Kadraq, xôq dii ni Kadraq hmơt kaluh daak dêh, yôôch Kadraq hnoq xakaq oot bơơn gay katôôlh maam, ji Kadraq joaq thung raniaq lok tađnưk đơơt tôq dayh rahưk rahưk ku Kơy Plêêk, Kơy Taay Yaak. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Kadraq e muuyq yal jah valơk tol aau kahliik ji tol kataalh Kadraq: “Vuua ku khơl vuua ji Lôôk ku khơl lôôk.”<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Yôôch gô hloq muuyq kơy yaak dưk đom mot hngơy, ji kơy nưq taayh tok dii muuyq apok kôt, đnooy kung dêq hloay kaluh paroh xêêp đong tapol tol plêêk, đaneq: “Dayh truh đnen, dayh anguk hlê ka waal xa kôt ku Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />xôq xa hlek khơl vuua, hlek khơl padrok kôt, hlek khơl adro kôk kalh, hlek kaluh ôô ahleh ji kuun acho tol ni, kung dii hlek ku tôôy manih, hloay rayơh rayơơy ji xapok, hloay khơl de ji khơl kôt.”<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Atêq nưq, gô hloq ôô ji khơl vuua tol vari kung bing kuun ku oot jah anguk tagumq hlê xôq tagay tahmơt dii Kơy acho tol ôô ahleh ji dii bing kuun ku Kadraq. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Yôôch ôô biq rôp, kung dii ni laa hlit pa ôôh, adro dưk dơơp kangưưr ni kaluh dơuq akêh, gamưh đnư đơu ni pa ôôh aluut khơl adro heq nhonq dơuq ku ôô ji khơl adro kuh ayuôôt vangưl ni. Dêq baarq tuôôy đong riirh biq taweek muut hlôôk ôôlh jah vuh jaq dii lưưu hwinh. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Sôôq măn hlê đom bing oot yôôych biq păk kaxêêt bơyh xieh ku Kơy acho tol ôô ahleh, 'ngưq laa xieh vlôh xing huuy Kadraq, ji dêq hloay kaluh xêêp jah phiq phơh xing hlek bing oot.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Yôôch gô hloq muuyq yaak plêêk kahri pôôt xing plêêk, adrơk gay kal ku raluk leh e kalek ji muuyq talơy looy tooy kôt đom ti kơy. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Kơy rôp xok ôô vayaa, 'ngưq laa volh hnu, đơu nưq laa kamuuych, long Sa-tan, yôôch kal ni hlê đom muuyq ravơu xanưm. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Kadraq taweek ni muut raluk be e kalek, yôôch kađnip ji kal qwat tol ni, xôq ni leh măn pa ôôh aluut kaluh daak dêh đnoyq dong truh tuôôy muuyq ravơu xanưm jah payôôch. Atêq nưq, ni pheq jah luh vlôh đom muuyq kawat lêq.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Yôôch gô hloq kaluh ngaai kung khơl manih 'ngôôy tol nưq ji qwuyen xưh xadrah heq jah kahniq ka oot, kaah phool hiel ku khơl dro heq biq dool akoq vii dơơp xanưk ku Lôôk Jê-xu ji vii apok ku Kơy Plêêk, kung dii dêq hloay khơl adro leh kuh ayuôôt ôô long vangưl ni, kung leh nhonq dơuq hlêêl ku ni tol ngưưl long tol ti oot, oot riirh hlê ji dưk xakaq kung dii Lôôk Wơơt Dêh đom muuyq ravơu xanưm. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />(Sôôq măn hlê đom khơl manih kaxêêt yôôych leh riirh hlê dong truh tuôôy heq dêq muuyq ravơu xanưm.) Nưq laa varơuq riirh hlê thưq nhưk. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Vanong hloay ji vah hloay ka dro leq e phon đom varơuq riirh hlê thưq nhưk! Varơuq kaxêêt thưq vaarq be e qwuyen kajoq tol khơl manih nưq, bơh oot hnoq laa thơy tơơk tưp ku Kơy Plêêk ji ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, ji hnoq kung Kadraq dưk xakaq đom muuyq ravơu xanưm.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Yôôch tuôôy muuyq ravơu xanưm jah payôôch, Sa-tan hnoq jah luh klơlh aduq karuk ku ni, <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />yôôch ni hnoq hooy vlôh pa ôôh aluut kaluh daak dêh măn poot panưh tol vari, tamooy Got ji tamooy Ma-got, xôq anguk oot hlê ka varơuq tahmơt. Bing kuun ku oot dang đaji choah tahli. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Oot garuk tok ranưh loch aduq tol vari ji dưk rawiit raap măn ku khơl vah kung theng xung xiaq, yôôch ôôlh kahri pôôt xing plêêk ji vuh jaq oot. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Yôôch kamuuych, adro pa ôôh aluut oot, biq taweek muut hlôôk ôôlh ji lưưu hwinh, đơu ôô kung hnhư hlit pa ôôh măn đom aduq nưq, ji oot hnoq biq jiq jiêh ka hngơy hloay ka klôôy dong truh đơơy đơơy, miet miet.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Atêq nưq, gô hloq muuyq ngaai ko kôt ji Kơy 'ngôôy tol ngaai, vari ji plêêk xadăk klôônq klơlh varơuq e mot ku Kadraq, đơu be e aduq leq jah deng ka oot. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Yôôch gô hloq khơl adro kaxêêt, kaah khơl kôt hloay khơl de, dưk kangưưr ngaai, ji kaluh rahlăp jah luh vlôh, yôôch muuyq rahlăp kadrơy jah luh vlôh, nưq laa Rahlăp Varơuq Riirh. Khơl kaxêêt biq xưh xadrah tyauq kaluh kajoq jah valơk hlê đom kaluh rahlăp nưq, tyauq tong kaluh varơuq dơơp ku oot. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Tahli bla hlê khơl adro kaxêêt 'laarq tahli, varơuq kaxêêt ji âm phuh bla hlê khơl adro kaxêêt aduq ni, ji tôôy muuyq dro biq xưh xadrah tyauq tong kaluh varơuq dơơp ku oot. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Yôôch varơuq kaxêêt ji âm phuh biq taweek muut hlôôk ôôlh. Neq laa varơuq kaxêêt yưk vaarq — 'ngưq laa hlôôk ôôlh. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Atoh adro leq biq xadrah hloq leh jah valơk đom Rahlăp Varơuq Riirh, yôôych adro nưq biq taweek muut hlôôk ôôlh.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Atêq nưq, gô hloq plêêk đơơu ji vari đơơu, vii plêêk thưq nhưk ji vari thưq nhưk heq tapol hlơơp, đơu tahli yôôych paq măn đnoyq. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Yôôch gô hloq theng vah, 'ngưq laa Jê-ru-sa-lem đơơu, pôôt xing aduq Kơy Plêêk tol plêêk, jah ralauq 'meq đaji muuyq amưưy pagooh pagaak deng ka kanau ni. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Gô tek muuyq apok đnooy kôt xing ngaai, đaneq: “'Yo hơq! Raap đơ ku Kơy Plêêk măn kung koot manih, ji Kadraq hnoq riirh dii oot, ji oot hnoq laa tamooy Kadraq, ji jơq Kơy Plêêk hnoq măn dii oot. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Muuyq sôôq rahlăp athêêp: </char><char style="fqa">đaji Kơy Plêêk ku oot, </char> bơh kaluh rahlăp đangq tuôq dik be e apok neq.</note> <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />Kadraq hnoq 'nhuôôt dêq daak mot klơlh mot oot, ji varơuq kaxêêt hnoq paq măn đnoyq, kung leh măn hlu rơu, long nhim ook, long jiq jiêh. Kaluh nưq hnoq paq măn đnoyq; vii kaluh varơuq adroyq dik heq dalơh yôôch.” <verse eid="REV 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Yôôch Kơy 'ngôôy tol ngaai xanoh: “'Yo nee! Gô dơơp đơơu tôôy varơuq.” Kadraq kung đnooy dii gô: “Dayh valơk hlê vii kaluh apok neq laa đangq tuôq ji dong dik.” <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Kadraq kung dăt gô: “Kaluh varơuq nưq heq payôôch! Gô laa An-pha ji Ô-mê-ga, laa kapa tep ji lôôch dik. Dro leq thaal, Gô hnoq ăm hôôch hloh hloh xing alook daak varơuq riirh. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Dro leq jay hnoq jah nhonq kaluh varơuq neq, ji Gô hnoq laa Kơy Plêêk ku dro nưq, măn dro nưq hnoq laa koot gô. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Bơh măn phon khơl adro kamo yôq, adro leh tuôq, adro đangq ramêq, adro păk kaxêêt manih, adro apuq atrăp, adro dưk dơơp đơơp pheep, adro akuh vangưl, kung tôôy adro đnooy lar, yôôych aduq ku oot laa đom hlôôk jah vuh jaq bơơn ôôlh ji lưưu hwinh, đơu nưq laa varơuq kaxêêt thưq vaarq.”<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Yôôch muuyq đom pơh yaak plêêk truh, laa xing khơl kơy e pơh dooy tađnưk viik pơh pơơl dal lôôch dik, ji yaak plêêk nưq đnooy dii gô, đaneq: “Dayh truh đnen, gô hnoq ăm ay hloq amưưy, kadrê ku Trưưu Koot.” <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Atêq nưq, Kơy taway gô hooy đom Kơy Phool Hiel truh muuyq ngok đoot kôt ji yơơt, yôôch pato ka gô theng vah Jê-ru-sa-lem apôôt xing aduq Kơy Plêêk tol plêêk, <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />e tađnah tađnaak ku Kơy Plêêk, kaveeh tađnah tađnưưl ku theng dang đaji kuk phơu quiq, đaji ngok thach anh hlăng hle dang pha lê. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />E apưt kôt ji yơơt, e kưl vaarq 'mok kôt kung kưl vaarq yaak plêêk aduq kaluh 'mok kôt, ji kaluh anơng jah valơk tol 'mok kôt, đơu nưq laa anơng kưl vaarq adrơơk ku khơl koot xau I-sơ-ra-ên. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Pe 'mok kôt măn pi mot hngơy vlok, pe 'mok kôt măn pi băk, pe 'mok kôt măn pi naam, ji pe 'mok kôt măn pi mot hngơy lôp. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Apưt theng e kưl vaarq poop kahnier, tol nưq laa kưl vaarq anơng kưl vaarq khơl jah rơơlh ku Trưưu Koot. <verse eid="REV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Kơy yaak plêêk đong đnooy dii gô e muuyq gay wolh bơơn vajang xôq kơy hnoq ik wolh theng, kaluh 'mok kôt theng ji apưt theng. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Theng jah panưk dơơp tyauq hinh vuông, pi yơơt ku theng xađong pi ranưh ku theng. Yaak plêêk nưq wolh theng dii gay wolh, jah kưl vaarq ravơu êt-ta-đơ: pi yơơt, pi ranưh ji pi yơơt atok ku theng laa xađong mamuuyq. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Kadraq kung wolh apưt theng, ahmol muuyq hreek poot kưl poot ku-đê tyauq gay wolh ku koot manih (đơu kung laa ku yaak plêêk). <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Kaluh thưq ku apưt theng laa ngok thach anh, măn theng phôq yôôych bơơn vajang ah, đaji ramil hlăng hle. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Kaluh kahnier ku apưt theng jah dơơp bơơn đuh thưq phơu quiq. Kahnier thưq nhưk laa ngok thach anh, thưq vaarq laa ngok bich, thưq pe laa ngok mah naoh, thưq poot laa ngok luk bưuh, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />thưq dăp laa hông mah naoh, thưq drơu laa phơu hwoang ngok, thưq pơh laa ngok hwoang bich, thưq thơơm laa ngok thwih thương, thưq xiit laa ngok hông bich, thưq kưl laa ngok phih twiq, thưq kưl muuyq laa ngok hông bưuh, thưq kưl vaarq laa ngok tưh bưuh. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Kưl vaarq 'mok kôt laa kưl vaarq kalook châu; đôôyq dii tôôy muuyq 'mok kôt yôôch jah dơơp xing muuyq kalook châu i apoop, măn trôôk kôt đom theng bơơn vajang ah, dang ramil hlăng hle. <verse eid="REV 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Gô leh hloq e hnhư hơu leq đom theng, vii Lôôk laa Kơy Plêêk, Kơy Taay Yaak kung Trưưu Koot laa hnhư hơu ku theng. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Theng leh duh e mot hngơy long xiêk xôq ahnhe tađnah ka theng, vii tađnah tađnaak ku Kơy Plêêk ahnhe tađnah theng, măn gooy đeen ku theng laa Trưưu Koot. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Kaluh tamooy hnoq hooy hlê gamưh xaraar tađnah ku theng nưq, ji khơl vuua tol vari taway tađnah tađnaak oot muut đnư. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Muuyq sôôq rahlăp hnu iaq đok: </char><char style="fqa">Khơl tamooy heq jah wơơt hooy hlê gamưh xaraar tađnah ku theng nưq</char>.</note> <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Tuôôt hngơy, kaluh 'mok kôt theng be hmưq 'leq biq kađnoch, vii be e ka klôôy aduq nưq. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Khơl drơy hnoq taway tađnah tađnaak ji varơuq vado ku kaluh daak dêh muut đnư, <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />đơu kaluh kajoq klơơr 'yêq long adro dơơp varơuq đangq ramêq ji pa ôôh aluut hnoq leh e 'leq muut đom theng, đêh vlôh khơl leq jah valơk đom rahlăp varơuq riirh ku Trưưu Koot.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Atêq nưq, yaak plêêk nưq pato ka gô tavook daak varơuq riirh, ah lalek đaji Pha lê, hoot vlôh xing ngaai ku Kơy Plêêk ji ku Trưưu Koot, <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />măn katul trôôk kôt ku theng. Panưh gah neq ji gah hơq ku daak laa ưk varơuq riirh ăm vlôh kưl vaarq play đêh raa, avlôh play ku ưk tyauq tong tưng xiêk, măn hla ku ưk deng ka varơuq paxêêk bingq ku kaluh daak dêh. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Hnoq paq măn varơuq karoay axaap leq đnoyq, ji ngaai ku Kơy Plêêk ji ku Trưưu Koot hnoq măn đom theng, măn khơl xapok Kadraq hnoq hơu varơuq Kadraq. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />Oot hnoq hloq mot Kadraq, ji yal Kadraq măn tol ngưưl oot. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Hnoq paq e ka klôôy đnoyq, oot paq e duh truh xaraar tađnah đeen long xaraar mot hngơy, vii Lôôk laa Kơy Plêêk hnoq ahnhe tađnah ka oot, ji oot hnoq dưk xakaq dong truh đơơy đơơy, miet miet.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Yôôch yaak plêêk nưq đnooy dii gô: “Kaluh apok neq laa đangq tuôq ji dong dik. Lôôk, laa Kơy Plêêk ku danưng kooy khơl kơy hlit, heq patăk yaak plêêk Kadraq kahnoq ka khơl xapok Kadraq kaluh varơuq pheq xalih truh kach talăng dayh.” <verse eid="REV 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />“'Yo hơq! Gô đong truh kach talăng dayh! Vanong ka dro tameng jư kaluh apok hlit ku rahlăp neq.”<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Gô, laa Jăng, kung laa dro hloq ji tameng kaluh varơuq neq. Tuôôy gô heq tameng ji hloq, gô kul xăk pôôt xôq ayuôôt laat hloay ka jôôk ku yaak plêêk, laa kơy kahnoq vlôh ka gô kaluh varơuq nưq, <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Măn yaak plêêk nưq đnooy dii gô: “Te dơơp anưq! Gô laa manih kung dơơp xapok dii ay, ji dii khơl oh ay ku ay, laa khơl hlit, kung khơl leq tameng jư kaluh apok ku rahlăp neq. Dayh ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk!”<verse eid="REV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Yôôch kơy dăt gô: “Te jư kadook kaluh apok hlit ku rahlăp neq, vii kawat đong măn jeq yôôch. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Adro leh hyioh jăk, dayh kưq leh hyioh jăk, Adro klơơr 'yêq, dayh kưq klơơr 'yêq. Manih hyioh jăk, dayh kưq dơơp varơuq hyioh jăk. Akơyq vah xarêh, dayh kưq jah vah xarêh.” <verse eid="REV 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />“'Yo hơq! Gô đong truh kach talăng dayh, ji kadrool ku Gô xatyauq kung dii Gô, xôq bla ka tôôy dro đaji kaluh varơuq dơơp ku dro nưq laa đaleq. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Gô laa An-pha ji Ô-mê-ga, laa adroyq dik ji atêq dik, laa kapa tep ji lôôch dik. <verse eid="REV 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Vanong ka khơl dro arôôh aau yơơt oot xôq oot hnoq jah qwuyen truh ưk varơuq riirh ji hooy hlê kaluh 'mok kôt muut đom theng. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Thêq ka: </char><char style="fq">Vanong ka khơl dro arôôh aau yơơt oot</char>, muuyq sôôq rahlăp hnu iaq đok: <char style="fqa">Vanong ka dro dơơp tyauq kaluh ganuun Kadraq</char>.</note> <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Pi gôk laa bơy xo, khơl đơơp pheep, khơl apuq atrăp, khơl păk kaxêêt manih, khơl akuh vangưl, kung tôôy adro xiaq trôôch ji dơơp varơuq pa ôôh lar.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />Gô, laa Jê-xu, heq patăk yaak plêêk ku Gô xôq dơơp xanưk ka koot kaluh varơuq nưq dii kaluh tayuup vah. Gô laa ưk ji koot xau ku Đa-vik, laa xalok maai tađnah tađnưưl.”<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Kơy Phool Hiel ji Amưưy đnooy: “Dayh truh!” Kơyq tameng, kung dayh đnooy: “Dayh truh!” Kơyq thaal, dayh truh. Kơyq trôôch, dayh nhonq xok daak varơuq riirh kach hloh hloh.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Gô dơơp xanưk ka tôôy dro tameng kaluh apok hlit ku rahlăp neq, đaneq: Atoh kơyq athêêp kajoq muut kaluh apok nưq, yôôych Kơy Plêêk hnoq athêêp ka dro nưq kaluh pơơl dal jah valơk đom rahlăp neq. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Atoh kơyq ka'lăk đơh xing kaluh apok ku rahlăp hlit neq yôôych Kơy Plêêk hnoq xok phon ku dro nưq aduq ưk varơuq riirh ji đom theng vah jah valơk đom rahlăp neq. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Muuyq sôôq rahlăp đok: </char><char style="fqa">Kơy Plêêk hnoq goch hơơp phon manih nưq đom Rahlăp Varơuq Riirh ji theng vah jah valơk đom rahlăp neq</char>.</note><verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Kơy dơơp xanưk kaluh varơuq neq xanoh: “Jơq! Gô đong truh kach talăng dayh.” Amen! Kuh Lôôk Jê-xu, xiin dayh truh!<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Apôôy vanong plêêk ku Lôôk Jê-xu măn kung khơl vah. Amen.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>